l":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-49纤程fiber","content":"生命周期状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"35":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-33","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-49纤程fiber","content":"（`i` 为剩余的迭代器，`g` 为迄今为止的累加器，`ω : d → 𝔑` 为已提交视图。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"36":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-34","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-49纤程fiber","content":"`installed_n(γ) := θ_n ≠ Inactive`。稳定状态是 `Inactive`（不贡献任何东西）和 `Active`（贡献其效应）。`Reloading` 和 `Unloading` 之所以存在，是因为实际的转移需要一段时间。**已提交视图（committed view）`ω` 把每个声明的键映射到转移提交时*提供该键的纤程的名字***。","locale":"zh-CN"},"37":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-35","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-50注册表registry","content":"状态携带 `F_γ : 𝔑 ⇀ 𝔉Γ`，其父指针构成一棵以 `root` 为根的树。**名字是原子**：从不被计算或检视，只做相等比较；新纤程取一个未被使用的名字（生成式名字）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"38":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-36","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-50注册表registry","content":"余效应上下文是**派生的，而不是存储的**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"39":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-37","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-50注册表registry","content":"由于 `dom(σ_n) ⊆ p_n`，且不同纤程的提供互不相交（由 O-Insert 保证），这一定义是良定的。因此每个键至多有一个可能的提供者 `provider_k(γ)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"40":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-38","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-50注册表registry","content":"重要推论：","locale":"zh-CN"},"41":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-39","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-50注册表registry","content":"只有 **Active** 纤程提供服务。`Reloading` 纤程已经把绑定写入自己的表，但这些绑定对依赖者尚不可见；`Unloading` 纤程已经停止提供，尽管其绑定仍然存在。正是这一点使提供者能够*在撤回任何东西之前先停止提供*。","locale":"zh-CN"},"42":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-40","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-50注册表registry","content":"引入领域（realm）的演算会把不相交条件放宽为“在同一领域内不相交”（§4.4，见元理论）。单一共享领域使提供非空的组件同一时刻只能有一个纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"43":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-41","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-51注册表投影","content":"`σ^S_γ := ⋃ { σ_m|_S | m ∈ dom(F_γ) }`：**所有**纤程（不只是 Active 纤程）在键集 `S` 上的绑定。见证条件在这里读取，因为转移自身的写入在纤程变为 Active 之前一直留在该纤程的表中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"44":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-42","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#九条规则42","content":"有两种关系：**编排**规则 `γ ⇒ δ`（编排器*可以*执行的动作；前提说明何时合法，而不是何时发生），以及**生命周期**规则 `γ ⟶ δ`（只要前提成立，系统就会主动执行）。任意交错都是合法的运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"45":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-43","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#九条规则42","content":"O-Retire 可在任意状态下设置 `τ`，图中省略。下面是论文记法下的同一张图：","locale":"zh-CN"},"46":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-44","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#编排421","content":"退役是一个**请求**，且无条件；由生命周期规则执行它。退役与移除分开，是为了让一个已退役的 Active 纤程先被停用（过早移除会丢弃累加器并导致泄漏）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"47":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-45","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#编排421","content":"O-Remove 先移除子纤程再移除父纤程，并且只移除表为空的条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"48":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-46","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#编排421","content":"O-Insert 的最后一个前提就是**单一来源纪律**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"49":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-47","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-52实例化","content":"`e_n` 的一次迭代可以实例化一个组件：它执行 `π = n` 的 O-Insert，并**以新纤程的 O-Retire 作为其逆操作产出**。逆操作*使其退役而不是移除*，因为逆操作必须总是可应用的，而 O-Remove 带有前提（一个 Active 子纤程会阻止它）。一个已退役、Inactive 且为空的条目是*残留的*（vestigial）（引理 62，见元理论）：它与不存在无法区分。使子纤程退役不会让父纤程等待；孙纤程逐层处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"50":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-48","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-53目标视图与静止","content":"（若纤程已退役或依赖未满足，目标为 `⊥`，否则把每个声明的键映射到其提供者。静止（quiescence）要求：Inactive 纤程的目标为 `⊥`，Active 纤程的目标等于其已提交视图，且没有纤程处于 Reloading/Unloading。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"51":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-49","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#定义-53目标视图与静止","content":"目标只取决于退役与余效应解析。**记录提供者的名字而不是值**，才使比较有意义：否则另一个提供相等值的纤程会被判为相等。（实现上：`fiber.committed` 保存该映射，`fiber.target` 保存其哈希。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"52":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-50","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#激活","content":"每次迭代以 `g ∘ h` 的方式组合其逆操作，因此累加器按 LIFO 顺序应用逆操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"53":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-51","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#停用","content":"停用不能是一步完成的：一个*因其提供者即将离开*而被拆除的消费者，其拆除代码可能恰恰需要那个提供者（例如把连接归还给连接池）。因此**决定**与**执行**被分开，并且执行受到守卫。","locale":"zh-CN"},"54":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-52","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#停用","content":"**定义 54：被依赖**：`relied_n(γ) := ∃m ≠ n, k ∈ d_m. installed_m(γ) ∧ ω_m(k) = n`","locale":"zh-CN"},"55":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-53","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#停用","content":"（L-Divert 的两个选项：中止（abort），或让当前迭代落地（land）。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"56":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-54","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#停用","content":"**L-Divert** 可以发生在任意两次迭代之间；它带着迄今为止累加的逆操作进入 Unloading（而不经过 Active，否则依赖者会针对一个即将离开的组件激活）。*中止*选项需要一个迭代边界；*落地*选项让正在进行的迭代完成（异步宿主需要它，§4.4）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"57":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-55","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#停用","content":"**L-Leave** 只记录决定：纤程停止提供（其表离开 `σ_γ`），而它自己的已提交视图和其他所有纤程的已提交视图都保持不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"58":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-56","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#停用","content":"**L-Unload** 是*唯一*应用累加器的规则；它最后才丢弃已提交视图。它的前提 `¬relied_n` 就是**守卫**：提供者的撤回要等到每个把某个键解析到它的消费者都离开之后。","locale":"zh-CN"},"59":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-57","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#停用","content":"守卫是**按绑定**的（检查已提交视图），并沿余效应排序，*而不是*沿纤程树排序：父纤程可以在其子纤程仍处于 Unloading 时运行自己的逆操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"60":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-58","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#停用","content":"守卫为何不会死锁：一旦提供者被标记（L-Leave 或 L-Divert），其表就离开 `σ_γ`，任何目标视图都不会再指向它，而每个提交到它的消费者自身也正在离开（定理 73，见元理论）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"61":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-59","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#停用","content":"这些规则是非确定性的，且不涉及调度器：对所有序列成立的定理对每种调度策略都成立。","locale":"zh-CN"},"62":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-60","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#停用","content":"**在 kardia 中**：纤程的目标是 `Target::Inactive`（`⊥`）或 `Target::Epoch { revision, providers }`，后者按 `inject` 顺序列出各提供者的 `ImplId`；`ImplId` 和 `FiberId` 永不复用。已提交视图（`ω`）是一个在整个生命周期片段（episode）内固定的键 → `ImplId` 映射；每个绑定都记录其已提交视图指向它的纤程集合（`relied_n`），守卫就等待这个集合清空。在插件的 `apply` 中，`ctx.checkpoint()` 是一个迭代边界：一旦本次加载已被取代或纤程已退役，它返回 `Err(Interrupted)`，这就是 L-Divert 的中止选项。见生命周期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"63":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-61","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#约束423","content":"**定义 55：约束于 `n`。** 若一个映射 (1) 只*写* `σ_n` 以及其他表在 `d_n` 的键上所存的值（对某个余效应进行操作的消费者会写提供者表中该键的值），从不写控制字段或注册表的定义域；并且 (2) 只*读* `σ_n` 和 `σ_m|_{d_n}`，则称它约束于 `n`。实例化是唯一的例外（它写入一个新条目；其逆操作写入一个 `τ`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"64":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-62","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#约束423","content":"**定义 56：`n` 的上下文中介迭代器。** 包含单位元和三种迭代形式的最小集合：在 `d_n ∪ p_n` 的某个键上提升一个操作阶段；在 `p_n` 的某个键上提升一个提供阶段（落入 `σ_n`）；一次实例化。**每个纤程的效应函数都必须属于这个集合。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"65":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-63","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#约束423","content":"**引理 57**：其成员约束于 `n`，并在 `≃_{d_n ∪ p_n}` 意义下带见证。","locale":"zh-CN"},"66":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-64","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#约束423","content":"实际含义：组件不得根据它未声明的纤程的生命周期状态做分支，不得读写其两项声明之外的表，也不得访问任何表都不持有的东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"67":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-65","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#表-1规则即写入","content":"规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"68":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-66","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#表-1规则即写入","content":"之前的 `θ`","locale":"zh-CN"},"69":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-67","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#表-1规则即写入","content":"之后的 `θ`","locale":"zh-CN"},"70":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-68","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#表-1规则即写入","content":"状态映射 `Ψ`","locale":"zh-CN"},"71":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-69","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#表-1规则即写入","content":"修改的控制字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"72":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-70","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#表-1规则即写入","content":"O-Insert","locale":"zh-CN"},"73":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-71","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#表-1规则即写入","content":"未定义","locale":"zh-CN"},"74":{"id":"/docs/concepts-calculus-72","page_id":"/docs/concepts-calculus","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts-calculus#表-1规则即写入","content":"`Inactive`","locale":"zh-CN"}