"},"666":{"id":"/docs/concepts-53","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#本部分的页面","content":"讨论、相关工作、结论","locale":"zh-CN"},"667":{"id":"/docs/concepts-54","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#本部分的页面","content":"讨论与相关工作","locale":"zh-CN"},"668":{"id":"/docs/concepts-55","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#本部分的页面","content":"<Card title=\"可撤销效应\" href=\"/docs/concepts-revertible-effects\" description=\"每个效应都返回其逆操作；按 LIFO 累加的逆操作能恢复组件开始时的上下文。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"669":{"id":"/docs/concepts-56","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#本部分的页面","content":"<Card title=\"响应式余效应\" href=\"/docs/concepts-reactive-coeffects\" description=\"组件声明它需要的键，并随上下文获得或失去这些键而激活或停用。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"670":{"id":"/docs/concepts-57","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#本部分的页面","content":"<Card title=\"上下文范式\" href=\"/docs/concepts-context-paradigm\" description=\"由一个上下文中介一切，使不同组件的效应在观察等价意义下相互独立。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"671":{"id":"/docs/concepts-58","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#本部分的页面","content":"<Card title=\"动态组合演算\" href=\"/docs/concepts-calculus\" description=\"纤程、注册表与九条规则，以及让提供者比其消费者存活更久的守卫。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"672":{"id":"/docs/concepts-59","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#本部分的页面","content":"<Card title=\"元理论与扩展\" href=\"/docs/concepts-metatheory\" description=\"保持性、恢复精确性、顺序性、一致性、进展性与合流性；异步、失败、隔离与配置。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"673":{"id":"/docs/concepts-60","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#本部分的页面","content":"<Card title=\"论文中的实现\" href=\"/docs/concepts-implementation\" description=\"表 2 与算法 1–10：论文所描述的 Cordis 如何实现演算、加载器和 HMR。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"674":{"id":"/docs/concepts-61","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#本部分的页面","content":"<Card title=\"讨论与相关工作\" href=\"/docs/concepts-related-work\" description=\"系统边界、服务代理、访问控制、语言要求、版本管理与相关工作，并附有关于 Rust 的说明。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"675":{"id":"/docs/concepts-62","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#预备知识2简述","content":"**效应**。判断形式为 `Γ ⊢ t : T ! effect`。单子效应（Moggi、Wadler）把带效应的计算封装在 `T(A)` 中，带有单位 `η` 和乘法 `μ`。代数效应（Plotkin 与 Power）声明操作签名；效应处理器（Plotkin 与 Pretnar）用定界延续来解释它们（Koka、Eff、OCaml 5）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"676":{"id":"/docs/concepts-63","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#预备知识2简述","content":"**余效应**。判断形式 `Γ @ coeffect ⊢ t : T` 标注的是*上下文*。余单子 `(D, ε, δ)`（Uustalu 与 Vene）为依赖上下文的计算提供结构；Petricek 等人提出把余效应作为一种统一的静态分析；分级余效应使用预序半环来量化使用情况。","locale":"zh-CN"},"677":{"id":"/docs/concepts-64","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#预备知识2简述","content":"**缺口**。二者都是作用于词法固定作用域的静态工具。没有任何固定的词法作用域能界定一个在部署之后才加载的插件，也没有任何编译期上下文能预见由运行时配置产生的依赖。因此论文把这些结构*具体化*，使运行时能够操作它们，并在动态中确立这些系统在静态中所保证的东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"678":{"id":"/docs/concepts-65","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"论文的术语：","locale":"zh-CN"},"679":{"id":"/docs/concepts-66","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"术语","locale":"zh-CN"},"680":{"id":"/docs/concepts-67","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"681":{"id":"/docs/concepts-68","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"上下文类型 `Γ`","locale":"zh-CN"},"682":{"id":"/docs/concepts-69","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"类型上下文在运行时可操作的具体化；`Γ∞ = μΓ. Γ × (Γ→Γ) × Σ`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"683":{"id":"/docs/concepts-70","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts#术语表","content":"效应上下文 `∂Γ`","locale":"zh-CN"},"684":{"id":"/docs/concepts-71","page_id":"/docs/concepts","tags":[],"ty