opment-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"1115":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-16","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"丢弃 `apply` future 会泄漏注册了一半的资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"1116":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-17","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"惯性（inertia）宿主 + 显式检查点（中断）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1117":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-18","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"引用环","locale":"zh-CN"},"1118":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-19","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"服务持有自己的 `Context`（→ `Root`），而 `Root` 持有服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-20","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"撤回绑定时打破环；`Root::shutdown().await` 释放根纤程并清空存储","locale":"zh-CN"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-21","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"表达式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-22","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"没有 JS 的 `eval`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-23","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"在第 4 阶段结束前在 CEL 与自定义求值器之间做出决定；在此之前拒绝表达式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-24","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"动态代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-25","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"Rust 没有模块注册表；卸载 dylib 不可靠","locale":"zh-CN"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-26","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"先做静态目录；用 WASM 后端实现真正的热重载 / 沙箱","locale":"zh-CN"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-27","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"类型级的键","locale":"zh-CN"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-28","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"字符串键可能冲突；`TypeId` 在不同 dylib 之间不稳定","locale":"zh-CN"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-29","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"进程内做 `TypeId` 检查；动态模块使用字符串 + 版本标记（论文 §6.6）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-30","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"错误消息一致性","locale":"zh-CN"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-31","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"TS 的消息 / 列号（UTF-16）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-32","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"在代价低时保留消息措辞；不追求 UTF-16 一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-33","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"这些问题在代码中是如何解决的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-34","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"**重入**：临界区把 `Action` 排入状态中（见并发）；在锁下释放的值在解锁之后才被丢弃。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-35","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"**引用环**：没有 `Root` 类型，也没有 `shutdown()`。释放根纤程（`root.fiber().dispose().await`）会重启它，并撤销注册在它上面的一切，从而撤回所有绑定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-36","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"**表达式**：决定采用一个无副作用的 JavaScript 子集（`kardia_loader::expr`），而不是 CEL；见状态与偏离。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-37","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"**动态代码**：先实现了静态目录；随后实现了 WASM、dylib 与进程后端（见动态模块）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-38","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#risks","content":"**类型级的键**：进程内的检查是访问时的向下转型（`AccessError::TypeMismatch`）。访客插件的服务以 JSON 值和 JSON 调用跨越模块边界（`GuestService`），因此没有任何 Rust 类型或 `TypeId` 跨越边界。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-39","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"一个提供者和一个消费者，基于插件 API 编写。第一个标签页是用现行 API 写的示例（只要提供 `connect` 及其连接池——它们是真实数据库客户端的占位——它就能针对工作区编译并运行）；第二个是计划中针对当时尚未实现的 API 的原始草图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1139":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-40","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"草图与代码之间的变化：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-41","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**根**：`Context::new()` 创建根上下文；`root.fiber().dispose()` 代替 `root.shutdown()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-42","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**错误**：`Result<()>`（`kardia_core::Result`）代替 `Result<(), PluginError>` 与 `anyhow::Result`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-43","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**声明**：`fn inject() -> Inject`（此处为 `Inject::of::<(Database,)>()`）代替 `type Inject`，`fn provide() -> Vec<Key>` 代替 `&'static [&'static str]` 切片。`#[derive(Service)]` 实现 `Service`（手写的 `impl Service for Database` 同样可用）。使用 `#[plugin]` 宏时，插件是一个接受 `Injected<(Database,)>` 的 `async fn`，这会把未声明的访问变成编译错误（见插件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1143":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-44","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**边界**：`ctx.checkpoint()?` 与 `ctx.on_dispose(..)?` 是同步且可能失败的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-45","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**配置**：`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)` 要求 `P::Config: Serialize`（该值会像其他任何配置一样被序列化再解码），因此只实现了 `Deserialize` 的配置要通过 `plugin_value` 以 JSON 传入。`db.update(value)?` 立即校验，并返回需要 await 的 future；`update_with(value, no_save)` 接受该标志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-46","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**等待稳定**：只要没有正在进行的转换，`greeter.settled()` 就会立即完成，因此示例先等待 `db` 稳定；数据库被提供之后，greeter 的转换才会开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1146":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-47","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**日志**：`ctx.logger_named(\"greeter\")`，或 `ctx.logger()`，后者以插件名命名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/development-risks-48","page_id":"/docs/development-risks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-risks#worked-example","content":"**依赖**：`#[derive(Deserialize)]` 需要在 crate 自身的依赖中加入启用 `derive` 特性的 `serde`，即使 `kardia::prelude` 重新导出了该 derive。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/development-server","page_id":"/docs/development-server","type":"page","content":"Server 架构与验收","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-server","locale":"zh-CN"},"1149":{"id":"/docs/development-server-0","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server","content":"Rust Server 系列的生命周期边界、固定上游对照、三平台证据和已说明的实现差异。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1150":{"id":"/docs/development-server-1","page_id":"/docs/development-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-server#architecture","content":"依赖与归属","locale":"zh-CN"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/development-server-2","page_id":"/docs/development-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"故障隔离与恢复","locale":"zh-CN"},"1152":{"id":"/docs/development-server-3","page_id":"/docs/development-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"固定对照与复现","locale":"zh-CN"},"1153":{"id":"/docs/development-server-4","page_id":"/docs/development-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-server#migration","content":"本次同步与迁移","locale":"zh-CN"},"1154":{"id":"/docs/development-server-5","page_id":"/docs/development-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-server#evidence","content":"验收记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/development-server-6","page_id":"/docs/development-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"历史验收记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/development-server-7","page_id":"/docs/development-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-server#boundaries","content":"与上游的关系","locale":"zh-CN"},"1157":{"id":"/docs/development-server-8","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server","content":"当前固定参考为 Cordis `6ad12cf2b39e7a22fe54b2f4568e948ecc778e97`。11 月 15 日同步更新了路径解码、Proxy 目录限制，以及 Static、include、HMR、CLI 模块解析共用的 FS 目录语义；同时修复 Rust effect 重复清理的等待行为，对应上游修复仍在未合并分支。五个 Server 包仍为原生 Rust 实现；本轮未升版本或发布。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/development-server-9","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#architecture","content":"`kardia-server` 使用 Hyper 1.12 提供 HTTP/1 传输、tokio-tungstenite 0.30 处理 WS 帧；路由、claimed 响应和生命周期由 Kardia 控制。`kardia-http` 使用 Reqwest 0.13.5、rustls 平台证书验证及显式流解压，避免 HTTP 库默认重定向/状态校验改变上游语义。生产实现不调用 Node。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1159":{"id":"/docs/development-server-10","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#architecture","content":"`Svc` 的 caller 决定路由、挂载、连接和流的效应归属；服务依赖从定义处解析。HTTP handler、中间件、route/upgrade hook 的在途任务以及响应源拥有可取消的任务集合。释放先撤销注册、停止任务并等待资源销毁，恢复随后才创建新实例。流采用有界传递；读取/轮询 panic 被转换为操作错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1160":{"id":"/docs/development-server-11","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#architecture","content":"Static 使用 FS provider，不直接绑定本地文件系统。内容探测有独立流；简单 file-type 规则和扩展名表由固定源码生成，复杂容器检测使用 Rust 流读取。生成器检查源码 hash，避免上游变化未经审计进入映射。picomatch-rs 0.1.0 的默认 POSIX 细节按实测修正。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/development-server-12","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"AGENTS.md 将隔离和可配置恢复规定为强制项目要求。默认 manual；retry 在失败实例外监督，以有界频率等待清理后恢复；host 回调决定保持失败或延迟重试。配置错误不循环重试。策略切换、禁用、移除和释放会取消旧动作，不把恢复写成配置更改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/development-server-13","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"验收范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/development-server-14","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"真实测试证据","locale":"zh-CN"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/development-server-15","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"核心监督与 loader","locale":"zh-CN"},"1165":{"id":"/docs/development-server-16","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"三种策略、重复失败、配置错误、宿主同步/异步 panic、取消待执行恢复、未注册 handler","locale":"zh-CN"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/development-server-17","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"Server","locale":"zh-CN"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/development-server-18","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"handler panic 前后状态；三种策略下占用端口启动失败/恢复，独立 Server 持续 HTTP 服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/development-server-19","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"HTTP 生命周期","locale":"zh-CN"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/development-server-20","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"dispose 返回前 pending 回调、body 源、中间件、route hook、upgrade hook 均销毁","locale":"zh-CN"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/development-server-21","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"Echo / ACL","locale":"zh-CN"},"1171":{"id":"/docs/development-server-22","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"各策略反复实例失败，健康路由继续工作；Echo 保持同一健康 WS 连接","locale":"zh-CN"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/development-server-23","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"FS / Static","locale":"zh-CN"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/development-server-24","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"provider 同步/轮询 panic、首读/后续流错误、取消、非本地挂载；恢复后流计数归零","locale":"zh-CN"},"1174":{"id":"/docs/development-server-25","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"HTTP client / Proxy","locale":"zh-CN"},"1175":{"id":"/docs/development-server-26","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"各策略重复 provider/实例失败、依赖消费者重建；健康 HTTP 和同一健康 WS 持续工作","locale":"zh-CN"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/development-server-27","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"上游不可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/development-server-28","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"当前 HTTP 操作失败、WS 不 accept；Proxy 仍 Active，上游恢复后无需重启","locale":"zh-CN"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/development-server-29","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"现有 guest 边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/development-server-30","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"workspace 回归包含进程退出/超时/I/O panic、WASM 与 dylib 路径；没有把 native dylib 描述为崩溃隔离","locale":"zh-CN"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/development-server-31","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"这些测试注入真实实现的错误、panic 或 Fiber 失败，并观察真实网络与清理计数。自动模式没有以手动 update 代替恢复；手动模式验证保持 Failed，之后才明确处理；host 模式遵循回调结果。失败只允许影响该实例及其不可用服务的消费者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/development-server-32","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"`crates/kardia-core/tests/recovery.rs` 承载\"宿主托管一组受监督插件\"的验收：无需任何驱动重启的自动恢复、保持失败直到显式处理的手动模式、宿主决策及其处理器错误被隔离、重复失败与恢复、以及释放在待执行重启时取消该重启——每一步都断言无关插件仍在服务。`crates/kardia-loader/tests/recovery.rs` 通过配置覆盖同样的场景。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/development-server-33","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#isolation","content":"隔离边界必须明确：in-process unwind 可捕获 Rust panic，但不能阻止 abort、segfault 或进程级退出。需要这种隔离时使用已有进程/WASM guest 边界；本轮没有新增任意原生代码沙箱。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/development-server-34","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"上游对照位于独立工作流 `.github/workflows/server-reference.yml`，仅用于手动验证。在 GitHub Actions 中选择 **Server reference → Run workflow**，即可运行 Linux、Windows、macOS 三平台对照。该工作流只有 `workflow_dispatch` 入口，不随 push、PR 或发布自动触发；常规 Rust 检查和故障隔离测试仍由主 CI 执行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/development-server-35","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"在仓库根目录构建 Rust 宿主，再从 `js/` 运行既有工具：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/development-server-36","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"准备脚本验证并构建忽略目录 `cordis/` 中的固定上游，使用 immutable Yarn 依赖，运行原始套件；不会重置未知上游工作区。`inventory.json` 使用上游 TypeScript 解析器展开 `it.each`，记录实际用例数，不把清单当通过证据。适配器仅注册场景和驱动真实服务，不重写被测算法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/development-server-37","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"测试类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/development-server-38","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"已通过范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/development-server-39","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"固定上游原始测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/development-server-40","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"Server 111：core 58、ACL 15、Static 25、Proxy 13；另有 FS 34（Linux/macOS 跳过 1 个 Windows 专项）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/development-server-41","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"补充/双端网络测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/development-server-42","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"Linux/macOS 224，Windows 226：原 201 用例，加 Proxy 10、Static 2、FS 11（Windows 再加 2）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/development-server-43","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"MIME 内容检测","locale":"zh-CN"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/development-server-44","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"固定 file-type 样本 SHA `7fc6d9ff7cc01987aa73006757792a5ca198023a` 的 254 文件及 2 补充样本，覆盖全部 171 MIME 值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/development-server-45","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"MIME 协商与 glob","locale":"zh-CN"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/development-server-46","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"1,180 个扩展名；26 组 Static 配置各 15 个路径；不归一化语义差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/development-server-47","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"原生平台","locale":"zh-CN"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/development-server-48","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"Linux、Windows、macOS 同时运行 Rust 检查与真实上游/对照","locale":"zh-CN"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/development-server-49","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"CLI/catalog","locale":"zh-CN"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/development-server-50","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"实际 CLI 子进程运行示例；catalog 包名、服务替换与消费者重建","locale":"zh-CN"},"1200":{"id":"/docs/development-server-51","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#parity","content":"HTTP 对比状态、reason、语义 header 和完整 body；大文件比较完整 SHA-256。WS 对比文本/二进制、字节、子协议和关闭码/原因。HTTPS/WSS 使用真实 TLS 证书夹具，另测不受信证书和主机名错误；没有跳过证书验证。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/development-server-52","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#migration","content":"路径参数保留 `+`；query 表单解码仍转为空格。Proxy 逐段编码，连接上游前拒绝越出 target 目录的请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1202":{"id":"/docs/development-server-53","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#migration","content":"FS base/intercept 和 Static root 都表示目录。include 将子条目作用域设为各配置文件所在目录，CLI 客体与 HMR 共用。`hmr.base` 改为 `intercept.fs.baseUrl`；原生 watch 仍接受原生路径，HTTP 客户端 base URL 保持普通 URL 语义。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/development-server-54","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#migration","content":"`Resolver::resolve` 新增 `&Context` 参数，移除 tree 的 `base_dir` API。Rust effect 只开始一次清理，重复调用等待 setup/cleanup 并共享错误，丢弃句柄不取消清理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1204":{"id":"/docs/development-server-55","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#migration","content":"保留默认手动、限速自动重试和宿主自定义恢复；无论策略如何，无关插件必须持续运行。没有新增 JS 生产包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/development-server-56","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#evidence","content":"Rust CI #43709794937 在 `aa14386` 上三平台全部通过，覆盖完整 workspace、故障/恢复测试、无默认 feature 检查、clippy、格式与架构。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1206":{"id":"/docs/development-server-57","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#evidence","content":"本次同步：手动触发的 Server reference #43709881683 在 `aa14386` 上通过 Linux、Windows、macOS。双端对照 Linux/macOS 各 224 用例、Windows 226 用例；Windows 同时运行了上游盘符专项。JS CI #43709794978 在同提交通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/development-server-58","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#evidence","content":"本地相关 Rust 套件、workspace/all-target clippy、架构与格式检查通过；网站类型检查和 41 个测试通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/development-server-59","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"历史基线：最初实现 CI #43705092966 的六个平台任务全部成功，绑定 `3226312`；同提交 JS CI #43705092953 成功。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/development-server-60","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"本机 `cargo test --workspace`、workspace clippy、fmt、arch、loader 无默认 feature 测试/clippy，以及 HMR process feature clippy 全部通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/development-server-61","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"首次 FS Windows 验收发现父路径为文件时系统返回 NotFound，而 Unix 返回 NotADirectory。测试改为原生期望，随后 CI #43700024799 成功；错误映射没有被掩盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/development-server-62","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"Static 首轮 macOS 的既有 include rename watcher 超时；同一提交仅重跑失败任务后 CI #43700396222 成功。最终提交再次完整通过三平台。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/development-server-63","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"本地旧 xtask 二进制曾内嵌仓库改名前的路径；仅清理该包编译缓存后，架构及完整 workspace 再次通过，没有修改断言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/development-server-64","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#历史验收记录","content":"被后续推送取消的中间 CI 不作为成功证据。原生 CI runner 不等于用户个人设备验收；本轮未执行用户个人设备独立测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/development-server-65","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#boundaries","content":"保留实测上游细节，包括返回 Response 丢弃自定义 reason、Proxy 最后一个 Set-Cookie、提供者上下文的 proxy publicUrl、错误页不同于普通文件的路径规则。详细契约见参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/development-server-66","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#boundaries","content":"Rust 使用类型化回调/服务和 UTF-8/serde 值，不重建整个 JS 对象模型。HTTP 辅助服务只覆盖 HTTP(S)/WS(S) raw transport、配置及生命周期；没有完整 decoder/file/data/SOCKS 生态，WS 客户端不提出 permessage-deflate。FS 扩展为 provider 只读流，保留已有 watch，没有增加写入生态。五个目标插件有实际生产实现，未另建五套 JS 产品或 guest 网络协议。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/development-server-67","page_id":"/docs/development-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-server#boundaries","content":"后续更换上游 SHA 时，先记录版本差异、更新共享场景，再生成映射、运行三平台对照和故障矩阵。所有规则、样本来源和可复现命令应保持长期可查；不要用“编译成功”或一次宿主重启替代隔离验收。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/development-status","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"page","content":"状态与偏离","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status","locale":"zh-CN"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/development-status-0","page_id":"/docs/development-status","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-status","content":"kardia 的实现阶段及其退出标准、实现状态，以及实现偏离计划或 TypeScript 代码的每一处。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/development-status-1","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#phases","content":"实现阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/development-status-2","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#status","content":"实现状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/development-status-3","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#deviations","content":"偏离","locale":"zh-CN"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/development-status-4","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#errors","content":"错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/development-status-5","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-status#loader-hooks","content":"加载器钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/development-status-6","page_id":"/docs/development-status","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/