d":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#goals-list","content":"**在语义上忠实于演算**（论文 §4）：纤程（fiber）、目标视图与已提交视图（committed view）、卸载时的守卫、惯性（inertia）、失败结果、每个（键，领域（realm））只有单一来源、合流性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/development-24","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#goals-list","content":"在论文未作规定之处，**在行为上与 Cordis 核心保持一致**（带修订号的纪元（epoch）、两级守卫、纤程级的并发释放、`update` 否决、`replace`），以 TypeScript 测试套件作为验收规范。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1447":{"id":"/docs/development-25","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#goals-list","content":"**地道的 Rust**：带类型的服务键、以显式的调用者归属代替 `Proxy`、可在多线程 tokio 运行时中使用的 `Send + Sync` 句柄、核心中没有 `unsafe`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/development-26","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#goals-list","content":"声明式的**加载器**（条目、分组、领域），以及基于文件、双向同步的 **include**（配置文件引入）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1449":{"id":"/docs/development-27","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#non-goals","content":"在运行时重新求值插件*代码*（HMR）。Rust 没有模块注册表；这会成为一个可选的、后续的“模块来源”扩展（加载器内部）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1450":{"id":"/docs/development-28","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#non-goals","content":"npm 专用的工具（`package-manager`、`create`、`loader-utils`）。不移植。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1451":{"id":"/docs/development-29","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#non-goals","content":"错误消息与 UTF-16 列号逐字节一致（有更好，但不要求）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1452":{"id":"/docs/development-30","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#non-goals","content":"HMR 只是最初几个版本的非目标。它后来已在 `kardia-hmr` 中实现（WASM、dylib 与进程后端，以及监视模式）；见状态与偏离。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1453":{"id":"/docs/development-31","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#decisions","content":"以下为摘要；每项决策的理由见最后一列链接的页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1454":{"id":"