e":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"1839":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-211","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"`100`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1840":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-212","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"同一时间窗口内的变化会一起重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1841":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-213","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#hmr","content":"重新加载的工作方式见热重载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1842":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-214","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#timer-and-fs","content":"`timer` 不接受配置；`fs` 可通过 `baseUrl` 配置 URL 解析和 provider 读流，原生监听保持已有路径行为。它们提供 `std:timer` 和 `std:fs` 服务；插件如何使用它们见服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1843":{"id":"/docs/guide-configuration-215","page_id":"/docs/guide-configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-configuration#timer-and-fs","content":"FS base 和各层拦截始终表示目录：pathname 补尾斜杠并清除查询/片段；拒绝 opaque base，Windows 绝对盘符路径转换为 file URL。include 通过 FS 解析路径，并将子条目的 FS 作用域设为所包含文件的目录；HMR 和 CLI 客体模块使用同一作用域。原 `hmr.base` 改用 `intercept: { \"std:fs\": { baseUrl: \"./plugins\" } }`；HTTP 客户端的 `baseUrl` 仍采用普通 URL 语义。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1844":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"page","content":"可撤销效应与纤程","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects","locale":"zh-CN"},"1845":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects","content":"登记逆操作，编写带初始化的效应，使用效应作用域与迭代边界，控制插件的纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1846":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"登记逆操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"1847":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#effects","content":"带初始化的效应","locale":"zh-CN"},"1848":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`EffectScope`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1849":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"迭代边界与中断","locale":"zh-CN"},"1850":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`EffectHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1851":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"释放顺序与错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"1852":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"纤程","locale":"zh-CN"},"1853":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#states","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1854":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#fiber-handle","content":"`Fiber` 句柄","locale":"zh-CN"},"1855":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#update","content":"更新、重启与释放","locale":"zh-CN"},"1856":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-effects#replace","content":"替换实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"1857":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects","content":"插件建立的一切（监听器、计时器、服务、子插件）都是**效应**（effect）：一次初始化，配上它的**逆操作**，即撤销它的撤销函数（disposer）。效应登记在插件的**纤程**（fiber）上；纤程卸载时，所有逆操作都会运行。正因如此，你可以在应用运行时重新配置、替换或停止任何插件，而不会泄漏它获取的资源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1858":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects","content":"本页介绍如何登记效应、效应如何被释放，以及纤程句柄能做什么。理论见可撤销效应；设计决策（非拥有的句柄、用惯性加载代替丢弃 future）见 API 设计；底层的状态机见核心数据结构。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1859":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects","content":"重复调用 `EffectHandle::dispose()` 会等待同一次清理并取得相同结果，包括清理失败；清理只执行一次，丢弃第一次返回的句柄不会取消清理。同步清理仍在 `dispose()` 返回前完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1860":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"最简单的效应，是为刚做的事登记一个普通逆操作：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1861":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1862":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"在当前纤程上登记","locale":"zh-CN"},"1863":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`ctx.on_dispose(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1864":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"一个同步逆操作 `f: FnOnce()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1865":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`ctx.defer(label, disposer)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1866":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"任意 `Disposer`，带一个在内省中显示的标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"1867":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"两者都返回 `Result<EffectHandle>`。在已退役的纤程上，它们以 `KardiaError::InactiveEffect`（`cannot create effect on inactive context`）失败；唯一的例外是：已退役但自身加载仍在进行的纤程仍可收集逆操作，随后的卸载会撤销它们，从而保证这次加载获取的东西不会泄漏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1868":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`Disposer` 是效应的逆操作。它在运行时被消耗，因此至多运行一次：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1869":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"构造函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1870":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"逆操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"1871":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`Disposer::new(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1872":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"同步的 `FnOnce()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1873":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`Disposer::fallible(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1874":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"同步的 `FnOnce() -> Result<()>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1875":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`Disposer::future(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1876":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"释放开始时同步运行 `f`，`f` 返回一个完成剩余工作的 future","locale":"zh-CN"},"1877":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"`Disposer::try_future(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1878":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"同上，future 可失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1879":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#inverses","content":"撤销函数中的 panic，无论同步还是异步，都会被捕获并作为错误报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1880":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#effects","content":"当初始化本身可能失败，或要登记多个逆操作时，把它写成效应体。效应体拿到一个 `EffectScope`，用来收集逆操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1881":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#effects","content":"**同步：** `ctx.effect_sync(label, |scope| { … })` 立即运行效应体。若效应体失败（或 panic），它已收集的一切都会被释放，并返回该错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1882":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#effects","content":"**异步：** `ctx.effect(label, |scope| async move { … })` 以任务形式运行效应体。它绝不会中途被丢弃：释放会等待它运行到结尾或到达迭代边界。失败时会释放效应体已收集的内容、记录日志，并通过 `EffectHandle::ready()` 报告。返回 `Interrupted`（见下文）不算失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1883":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1884":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1885":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`scope.defer(disposer)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1886":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"收集一个逆操作，不设迭代边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"1887":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`scope.defer_fn(f)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1888":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"推迟一个同步逆操作的简写","locale":"zh-CN"},"1889":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`scope.adopt(handle)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1890":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"把一个嵌套效应移到当前效应之下：它不再由纤程直接释放，而是随当前效应一起释放（所有权转移）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1891":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`scope.checkpoint()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1892":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"迭代边界：效应被释放后返回 `Err(Interrupted)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1893":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`scope.yield_(disposer)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1894":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"收集一个逆操作并标记一个迭代边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"1895":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"`checkpoint` 和 `yield_` 是同步的，返回 `Result<(), Interrupted>`，用 `?` 传播即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1896":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#scope","content":"在效应体内用 `ctx.effect(..)` 或 `ctx.effect_sync(..)` 创建的嵌套效应，与其他效应一样登记在纤程上。`scope.adopt(handle)` 接管它，使它在（且仅在）外层效应撤销时撤销。任何 `Fiber` 都可转换为创建它的那个 `EffectHandle`，因此作用域也可以接管子插件：`scope.adopt(&ctx.plugin::<Child>(())?)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1897":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"已被取代的加载（插件被重新配置、依赖发生变化或被释放）不会通过丢弃其 future 来取消：在\"获取资源\"和\"登记其逆操作\"之间被丢弃的 future，恰恰会泄漏效应承诺回收的东西。因此宿主（host）是**惯性**（inertia）的：过期的加载会运行到结尾，然后被卸载。若想更早停止，加载需要在显式的**迭代边界**处检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1898":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"1899":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"以 `Interrupted` 失败的时机","locale":"zh-CN"},"1900":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"`ctx.checkpoint()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1901":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"在插件的 `apply` 中，当其加载已被取代或纤程已退役（论文的 L-Divert）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1902":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"`scope.checkpoint()` / `scope.yield_(d)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1903":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"在效应体中，当该效应已被释放","locale":"zh-CN"},"1904":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#interruption","content":"用 `?` 传播 `Interrupted` 不算失败：纤程（或效应）不会变成 `Failed`，已登记的内容照常释放。`Error::is_interrupted()` 可以把它和真正的错误区分开。加载器对带 `inject` 的条目使用这种模式：外层纤程解析插件，执行 `ctx.checkpoint()?`，然后启动内层纤程。其中的理由见 API 设计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1905":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"每次登记效应都返回一个 `EffectHandle`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1906":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1907":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-62","page_