,"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`EffectHandle` 是**非拥有**的：丢弃它不会释放效应。效应的生命期由它登记所在的纤程决定，这正是论文区分 Cordis 与 RAII 之处。词法作用域是互补的，适用于某个效应内部的局部资源：在撤销函数内部，普通的 `Drop` 类型完全可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1919":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#handle","content":"`Disposal` 表示一次释放的完成。它无需被轮询就会推进：`dispose()` 返回时同步部分已经运行完毕，异步的剩余部分作为单独的任务运行，所以丢弃 `Disposal` 不会取消它。等待它即可观察结果；`disposal.is_ready()` 表示是否一切都已同步完成。释放一个初始化仍在运行的异步效应时，会先等待初始化结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1920":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"**在一个效应内部**（一个 `effect_sync` 效应体、一个 `effect` 效应体，或一个作用域接管的逆操作），逆操作**按从新到旧的顺序依次**运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1921":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"同步逆操作立即运行；从第一个异步逆操作起，其余部分作为单独的任务运行；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1922":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"即使前面的逆操作失败，每个逆操作仍会运行，结果是第一个错误；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1923":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"推迟到一个正在被释放的效应上的逆操作会立即运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1924":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"**纤程卸载时**，运行时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1925":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"等待，直到不再有消费者依赖该纤程提供的服务（每个消费者先完成自己的拆除）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1926":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"按从新到旧取出纤程的效应；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1927":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"**并发地**释放它们，记录每个失败和 panic；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1928":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"然后释放该纤程所提交的服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1929":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"因此同一纤程的兄弟效应并发清理，这是 Cordis 的测试所要求的（`service-dispose.spec.ts`）。若拆除步骤必须有序，请把它们放进**同一个**效应：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1930":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#order","content":"卸载父插件会级联到子插件：每个子插件都是其父插件的一个效应，所以父插件卸载时会释放它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1931":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"**纤程**是插件的一次实例化。实例化插件时，会在当前纤程上登记一个效应，其逆操作让新纤程退役：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1932":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1933":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"实例化","locale":"zh-CN"},"1934":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"`ctx.plugin::<P>(config)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1935":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"带类型化配置的类型化插件（`P::Config: Serialize`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1936":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"`ctx.plugin_value::<P>(value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1937":{"id":"/docs/guide-effects-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-effects#fibers","content":"以原始 JSON 配置实例化类型化插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1938":{"id":"/docs/g