e_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`GuestService::emit`（宿主到访客的事件）与 `Host::detached()`（导出外调用宿主）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2056":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"不支持：没有到运行中实例的通道，调用返回错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2057":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"同左","locale":"zh-CN"},"2058":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"支持（`kardia-guest/3`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2059":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"单实例并发 `call`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2060":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"串行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2061":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"串行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2062":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"支持（`kardia-guest/3`）；版本 1、2 的访客仍串行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2063":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**WebAssembly。** `WasmSource` 在 wasmtime 上运行核心 WebAssembly 模块，而不是 WIT 组件，因此访客不需要组件工具链（测试用 WAT 编写）。模块每个版本编译一次，并为每个纤程在各自的 store 中实例化。`WasmSource::with_limits` 为每个实例设置上限：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2064":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"燃料或时间耗尽的导出会触发陷阱（trap），该实例之后的调用以 `the guest was stopped: …` 失败；内存增长超过上限也会触发陷阱。设置了时间上限时，调用者自己的截止时间（`call_timeout`、`call_async`）同样生效。`WasmSource::new()` 不设置任何上限。这些失败都是带类型的 `GuestFailure`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2065":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"要像 `ProcessGuest::plugin` 那样从外部给出 WASM 插件的元数据，可以把模块编译为 `WasmGuest`：`WasmGuest::new(bytes, limits)` 在自己的引擎上编译 WASM 字节或 WAT 文本，`source.guest(bytes)` 则在某个 `WasmSource` 的引擎上、按它的上限编译。两者都不实例化模块。`plugin(meta)` 生成插件，每个实例启动时必须声明相同的元数据；`module(id)` 则像 `WasmSource` 那样从一个实例中读取元数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2066":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**macOS 上的陷阱处理**。在 macOS 上，wasmtime 默认通过 Mach 异常端口处理 WASM 陷阱。它的陷阱处理器是进程级的：wasmtime 在创建第一个引擎时安装它，之后的引擎若要求另一种设置，wasmtime 会 panic。`kardia::hmr::set_macos_mach_ports(false)` 让 kardia-hmr 创建的每个引擎改用 Unix 信号。请在创建第一个 `WasmSource` 或 `WasmGuest` 之前调用它：此后再要求另一种设置会返回错误，且不改变任何东西。应用自己用 wasmtime 创建的引擎必须使用相同的设置。在 macOS 以外的平台上，这个调用不改变任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2067":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**动态库。** `DylibSource` 使用 C ABI，而不是传递 Rust 类型：`cdylib` 自带一份 `kardia-core` 和 tokio，静态变量各自独立，也没有运行时上下文。每次加载都会把库复制到一个新路径（位于临时目录下的 `kardia-dylib-<pid>` 目录中），因为平台加载器对已知路径会直接交出已加载的那个库。库永不卸载：一旦 Rust 代码注册了线程局部析构函数或交出了 `'static` 引用，卸载它就是不健全的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2068":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**子进程。** `ProcessSource` 把每个插件实例作为独立进程运行，通过 stdin 和 stdout 以 JSON 行的形式使用访客 ABI（见进程传输）。进程结束的访客只会让它自己的插件失败；破坏协议或超过调用截止时间的访客会被杀死。命令行参数、spawner、超时和退出报告见进程访客。替换可执行文件时，请把新文件重命名覆盖到原路径：正在运行的可执行文件不能被写入，而以写方式打开着的文件不能被启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2069":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"**三者的共同点。** `GuestService::call` 会阻塞调用者直到访客应答；`call_async` 则在异步工作线程之外执行调用，桥接插件执行 `apply` 和 `dispose` 时也是如此。截止时间可以终止进程访客（将其杀死）和设置了时间上限的 WASM 访客（触发陷阱）；dylib 访客运行在调用者的线程上，无法被终止。没有单独的代理（broker）服务：每个纤程的 `GuestService` 就是 RPC 端点。这些后端是 `kardia-hmr` 的 cargo 特性（`wasm`、`dylib`、`process`，默认全部开启）；另有 `preserve-order`（默认开启），它通过 `kardia-loader` 开启 `serde_json/preserve_order`，关闭它可让应用保留 serde_json 的默认映射（键顺序）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2070":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#backends","content":"`kardia` 二进制按文件扩展名选择后端：`.wasm` 和 `.wat` 交给 `WasmSource`，其他一律交给 `DylibSource`。基于库构建的应用可以自行选择：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2071":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"访客通过 `Host::provide` 提供服务。在宿主一侧，每个这样的服务都是一个 `kardia::hmr::GuestService`，其 JSON 视图就是访客提供的值：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2072":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`GuestService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2073":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`value()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2074":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"访客提供该服务时给出的 JSON 值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2075":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`call(method, args)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2076":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"以 `{ key, method, args }` 调用访客的 `cordis_call`，返回其 JSON 结果；阻塞直到访客应答，或直到访客的默认超时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2077":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`call_timeout(method, args, timeout)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2078":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"与 `call` 相同，但超过 `timeout` 后以 `the guest did not answer in time` 失败；此时进程访客会被杀死，之后的调用也会失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2079":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`call_async(method, args, timeout)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2080":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"在异步工作线程之外执行调用，可设置超时；丢弃该 future 即取消调用（`kardia-guest/2` 访客会收到通知，其结果被丢弃）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2081":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`is_available()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2082":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"实例是否仍能应答：未被释放，且其进程没有退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2083":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"`handle()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2084":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"进程访客的 `GuestHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2085":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-service","content":"提供该服务的纤程消失后，调用以 `the guest instance is disposed` 失败；进程访客自行结束后，以 `the guest process exited` 失败；访客返回的不是 JSON 时，以 `invalid result of <key>.<method>: …` 失败。访客回调到一个已在同一线程上运行的实例（直接或经由其他访客）时，会以 `re-entrant call into a guest instance` 失败，而不会死锁。与任何服务一样，访客的纤程被释放时，访客服务随之撤回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2086":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`ProcessSource` 把模块 id 当作程序运行，不带参数。`ProcessGuest` 描述一条访客命令及其选项；可以直接使用，也可以在你自己的 