e-guests-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"访客可发送的最长一行（默认 16 MiB）；更长的一行会使访客被杀死","locale":"zh-CN"},"2098":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`plugin(meta)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2099":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"访客的插件，其 `GuestMeta`（`new(name)`、`.inject(key)`、`.provide(key)`）由调用者给出。每个进程启动时必须声明相同的元数据（相同的名称，以及顺序不限的相同服务），否则其纤程失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2100":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"`module(id)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2101":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process-guests","content":"访客的模块，其元数据从为此启动的进程中读取","locale":"zh-CN"},"2102":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#spawner","content":"`Spawner` 负责启动进程，由应用决定访客如何运行（沙箱、进程组、拥有它的进程管理器）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2103":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#spawner","content":"它得到命令的程序、参数、环境变量和工作目录（`get_program`、`get_args`、`get_envs`、`get_current_dir`，或用 `to_std()` 得到 `std::process::Command`），并返回一个 `GuestProcess`：进程的 stdin 和 stdout，可选的 stderr（`.stderr(…)`，用于退出报告），以及一个 `GuestChild`，即实例在进程结束前一直持有的控制句柄（`id`、`kill`、`try_wait`、`wait`，与 `std::process::Child` 相同）。`GuestProcess::from_child` 接受以管道方式启动 stdio 的 `std::process::Child`。默认的 `StdSpawner` 用 `std::process` 在应用的环境加上命令的变量中运行命令。实例用完进程时（释放时，或访客失败时）会杀死它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2104":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#exit","content":"每个进程访客都有一个 `GuestHandle`，可从 `GuestService::handle()` 或 `GuestStarted` 事件获得：",