"id":"/docs/guide-guests-167","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#build","content":"对于**进程访客**，在 crate 中加入一个二进制，其 `main` 负责服务访客。请使用 `crate-type = [\"cdylib\", \"rlib\"]`，以便二进制能使用这个库：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2176":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-168","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#build","content":"`serve` 应答宿主通过 stdin 以 JSON 行发来的导出调用，直到宿主释放该实例或 stdin 关闭。宿主提供 `kardia-guest/2` 时它使用该协议，否则使用协议版本 1：前一种情况下由一个线程读取 stdin，因此导出运行期间也能应答 ping，`Host::cancelled` 也能看到取消。stdout 用于承载协议，因此进程访客不得向它打印；应通过 `Host::log` 或 stderr 记录日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2177":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-169","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#deps","content":"模块可以依赖其他模块，也可以导出一个值而不是插件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2178":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-170","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#deps","content":"`shared.wasm` 变化时，热重载也会重载 `greeter`，因为它导入了发生变化的模块（见 reconcile 事务）。既不导出插件也不导出值的模块什么也不导出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-171","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"访客中的错误或 panic 只会让该插件或该次调用失败：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"访客 panic 时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"访客消失时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"dylib","locale":"zh-CN"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"SDK 捕获它并作为错误返回：`the guest panicked: <message>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"崩溃会使宿主崩溃","locale":"zh-CN"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"process","locale":"zh-CN"},"2187":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"SDK 捕获它并作为错误返回：`the guest panicked: <message>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2188":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"已退出的进程会以其退出报告使插件的纤程失败，其调用以 `the guest process exited` 失败；破坏协议（`invalid message from guest: …`）、发送超过帧上限的一行或超过调用截止时间（`the guest did not answer in time`）的进程会被杀死，结果相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"WebAssembly","locale":"zh-CN"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"访客中止（abort），宿主把中止报告为一次失败的调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"设置上限时，燃料或时间耗尽的导出触发陷阱，该实例之后的调用失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2192":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-184","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"`apply` 返回的错误会使插件的纤程失败（`Failed`）；`call` 返回的错误只让该次调用失败，实例继续运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-185","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"`dispose` 中的 panic 会被吞下，因为宿主没有可报告的对象。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-186","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"已释放或已失败实例的进程绝不会继续运行；`dispose` 之后宿主会杀死它，`dispose` 本身也受访客超时的限制（未设置时为 5 秒）。宿主消失时，进程访客会退出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-187","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"读取模块元数据（`meta`）期间没有插件上下文：宿主调用以 `host calls are unavailable while reading module metadata` 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-188","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#failures","content":"访客只能提供其元数据在 `provide` 中声明的服务：提供其他服务会以 `cannot provide \"<key>\": the plugin does not declare it in provide` 失败，且不提供任何东西，因此没有消费者能看到该服务，哪怕是短暂地。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2197":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-189","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"当访客实例本身失败（而不是访客报告一个错误）时，调用以 `kardia::hmr::GuestFailure` 失败：它的 `kind`（一个 `GuestFailureKind`）说明失败的方式，其文本就是错误消息，与以前相同。`GuestFailure::of(&error)` 从 `kardia_core::Error` 中找出它，`error.downcast_ref::<GuestFailure>()` 也可以。访客自己报告的错误（失败状态码，或 SDK 返回的错误）、缺少的导出、已释放的实例，以及因等待另一个调用结束而超时的调用，都不是 `GuestFailure`；实例继续运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2198":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-190","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"`GuestFailureKind`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-191","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"何时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2200":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-192","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"`Trap`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-193","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"WASM 访客触发陷阱（`wasm trap: …`），或在它运行时某个宿主函数失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-194","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"`OutOfFuel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2203":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-195","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"WASM 导出耗尽了燃料；该实例之后的调用以同样的方式失败（`the guest was stopped: …`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2204":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-196","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"`Timeout`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2205":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-197","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"WASM 导出在截止时间被中断（该实例之后的调用以同样的方式失败），或进程访客在截止时间被杀死（`the guest did not answer in time`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2206":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-198","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"`OutOfMemory`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2207":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-199","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"WASM 访客的内存增长被拒绝（`forcing trap when growing memory …`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2208":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-200","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"`Exited`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2209":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-201","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"访客进程自行结束（`the guest process exited`；纤程的失败则是其退出报告）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2210":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-202","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"`Killed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2211":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-203","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"访客进程被杀死：它破坏了协议、发送了超过帧上限的一行、为它服务的线程发生了 panic，或宿主杀死了它（纤程以其退出报告失败）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2212":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-204","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"`Panicked`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2213":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-205","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"某次访客调用在宿主一侧发生了 panic，或 WASM 的 epoch 线程发生了 panic（此后设有时间上限的调用都会失败）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2214":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-206","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#guest-failure","content":"kardia-hmr 启动的线程（进程访客的 `guest-stdin`、`guest-stdout`、`guest-stderr` 线程，以及设有时间上限的引擎的 `wasm-epoch` 线程）会捕获自己的 panic：此时进程访客会被杀死，其退出报告和失败调用的原因为 `the <thread> thread panicked: <message>`。如果 panic 钩子会在遇到不确定是否被捕获的 panic 时中止进程，可以询问 `kardia::hmr::is_panic_contained()`，它在这些线程上为 true。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2215":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-207","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"其他语言编写的访客需实现这一接口，它也记录在 `kardia-hmr` 的 crate 文档中（`cargo doc -p kardia-hmr --open`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2216":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-208","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"数据以字节缓冲区中的 UTF-8 JSON 形式跨越边界。宿主为每个实例保留一条**消息**：先是被调用导出的输入，之后是上一次宿主调用的结果。访客按给定的长度分配内存后，用 `read` 把消息复制到自己的内存中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2217":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-209","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"**导出**（状态 `0` 表示成功；失败时访客用 `write` 写出错误）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2218":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-210","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"WASM","locale":"zh-CN"},"2219":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-211","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"dylib","locale":"zh-CN"},"2220":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-212","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`memory`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2221":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-213","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`cordis_new() -> state`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2222":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-214","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"内存 / 每个实例的访客状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2223":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-215","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`cordis_meta() -> i32`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2224":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-216","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`cordis_meta(state, host) -> i32`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2225":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-217","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`write` 出 `{ deps?, plugin?: { name?, inject?, provide? }, value? }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2226":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-218","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`cordis_apply(len) -> i32`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2227":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-219","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`cordis_apply(state, host, len) -> i32`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2228":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-220","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"消息：`{ config, imports }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2229":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-221","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`cordis_call(len) -> i32`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2230":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-222","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`cordis_call(state, host, len) -> i32`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2231":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-223","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"消息：`{ key, method, args }`；`write` 出结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2232":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-224","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`cordis_dispose()`（可选）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2233":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-225","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`cordis_dispose(state, host)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2234":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-226","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"最后一次调用；dylib 在此释放 `state`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2235":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-227","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`deps` 是相对于本模块的模块路径；`imports` 把每个导出了 `value` 的依赖映射到该值。既不导出插件也不导出值的模块什么也不导出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2236":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-228","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"**名称。** 每个导出和 dylib 符号也可以用 `kardia_*` 代替 `cordis_*` 命名（`kardia_meta`、`kardia_new` 等）。宿主对每一项都先查找 `kardia_*`，找不到时再查找 `cordis_*`，因此访客可以只导出其中一套、混用两套，或两套都导出：两者都存在时，宿主调用 `kardia_*` 的那个。WASM 宿主函数同时在 `kardia` 和 `cordis` 两个导入模块下提供，一个模块可以从其中任意一个或两个导入。kardia-hmr 0.2.0 及更早的宿主只认识 `cordis_*` 和 `cordis`，因此 `kardia-guest`（以及 pykardia 的导出工具）会以两套名称导出每一项，并从 `cordis` 导入宿主函数：这样构建的访客在新旧宿主上都能加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2237":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-229","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"**宿主函数**（WASM 从模块 `cordis` 或 `kardia` 导入；dylib 则是 `host` 结构体 `{ host, read, write, log, provide, view, invoke }` 中的函数指针，每个都以 `host.host` 作为第一个参数）。指针是访客地址，长度是字节数：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2238":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-230","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`read(ptr)` 把消息复制到 `ptr`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2239":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-231","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`write(ptr, len)` 设置当前导出的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2240":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-232","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`log(level, ptr, len)` 以插件的身份记录日志（`0` error … `3` debug）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2241":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-233","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`provide(key, key_len, value, value_len) -> i32` 把服务 `key` 作为 `GuestService` 提供，其 JSON 视图为 `value`。插件元数据未在 `provide` 中声明的键会以错误被拒绝，且不提供任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2242":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-234","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`view(key, key_len) -> i32` 按插件所声明 `inject` 的受检访问规则，读取某个服务的 JSON 视图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2243":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-235","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"`invoke(key, key_len, method, method_len, args, args_len) -> i32` 调用一个 `GuestService`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2244":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-236","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"返回 `i32` 的宿主函数会把消息设为其结果并返回其长度；或把消息设为错误消息并返回 `-1 - len`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2245":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-237","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#abi","content":"**模块的生命周期。** 加载模块时会实例化它一次以读取元数据（先 `meta`，再 `dispose`）；`deps` 中的依赖先加载。之后运行该插件的每个纤程都会得到一个新实例：以 `{ config, imports }` 调用 `apply`，任意次 `call`，以及纤程被释放时的 `dispose`，之后实例被丢弃。状态非零且没有写出任何内容时，以 `guest failed with status <n>` 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2246":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-238","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"进程访客通过 stdin 和 stdout 每行交换一个 JSON 对象（stdout 专用于此；访客通过 `log` 或 stderr 记录日志）。协议有三个版本：版本 1；`kardia-guest/2`，在版本 1 之上增加了握手、请求 id、取消和 ping；以及 `kardia-guest/3`，在版本 2 之上允许同一实例的多个调用同时在途、允许宿主向访客发送事件，并允许访客在任何时刻调用宿主。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2247":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-239","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"**握手。** 宿主以 `{\"export\":\"hello\",\"input\":{\"protocol\":\"kardia-guest/2\"}}` 开场——这是 0.2 版访客唯一认识的名字。访客回答**它能说的最高版本**：`{\"ready\":\"kardia-guest/3\"}` 或 `{\"ready\":\"kardia-guest/2\"}`，宿主按这个回答为它服务。版本 1 的访客对任何不认识的导出都应答 `{\"done\":1}`，宿主随后按版本 1 为它服务。因此用 `kardia-guest` 0.2 构建的访客在新宿主上照常运行；反过来，用新 SDK 构建的访客不能在只认识版本 2 的旧宿主上运行，旧宿主会对 `ready: \"kardia-guest/3\"` 报未知协议。在握手时限内没有应答的访客会被杀死。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2248":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-240","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"**版本 1：**","locale":"zh-CN"},"2249":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-241","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"方向","locale":"zh-CN"},"2250":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-242","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"消息","locale":"zh-CN"},"2251":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-243","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2252":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-244","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"宿主 → 访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"2253":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-245","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`{ export, input }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2254":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-246","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"一次导出：`export` 为 `meta`、`apply`、`call`、`dispose` 之一；`input` 是消息（为空时为 `null`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2255":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-247","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"访客 → 宿主","locale":"zh-CN"},"2256":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-248","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`{ call: \"log\", level, text }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2257":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-249","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"记录日志；无应答","locale":"zh-CN"},"2258":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-250","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"访客 → 宿主","locale":"zh-CN"},"2259":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-251","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`{ call: \"provide\", key, value }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2260":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-252","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"以 `{ result }` 或 `{ error }` 应答（未声明的 `key` 是错误）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2261":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-253","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"访客 → 宿主","locale":"zh-CN"},"2262":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-254","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`{ call: \"view\", key }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2263":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-255","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"以 `{ result }` 或 `{ error }` 应答","locale":"zh-CN"},"2264":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-256","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"访客 → 宿主","locale":"zh-CN"},"2265":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-257","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`{ call: \"invoke\", key, method, args }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2266":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-258","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"以 `{ result }` 或 `{ error }` 应答","locale":"zh-CN"},"2267":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-259","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"访客 → 宿主","locale":"zh-CN"},"2268":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-260","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`{ output }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2269":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-261","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"设置导出的结果文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2270":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-262","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"访客 → 宿主","locale":"zh-CN"},"2271":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-263","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`{ done: status }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2272":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-264","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"结束这次导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2273":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-265","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"**`kardia-guest/2`** 发送相同的消息，但每条都带有 `id`：每次导出带一个新的 `id`，与它有关的每条消息都带同一个 `id`（`{\"id\":3,\"call\":\"view\",\"key\":\"db\"}`、`{\"id\":3,\"result\":…}`、`{\"id\":3,\"output\":…}`、`{\"id\":3,\"done\":0}`）。宿主一次只调用一个导出。另有两条消息不需要正在运行的导出：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2274":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-266","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"方向","locale":"zh-CN"},"2275":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-267","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"消息","locale":"zh-CN"},"2276":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-268","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2277":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-269","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"宿主 → 访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"2278":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-270","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`{ cancel: id }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2279":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-271","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"调用者不再需要导出 `id`：访客可以提前结束；宿主丢弃其结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2280":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-272","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"宿主 → 访客","locale":"zh-CN"},"2281":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-273","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`{ ping: n }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2282":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-274","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"以 `{ pong: n }` 应答，即使有导出正在运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2283":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-275","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"**`kardia-guest/3`** 保留上述全部消息，只改它们的关联方式，并增加两条：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-276","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"变化","locale":"zh-CN"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-277","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-278","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"导入可以同时在途","locale":"zh-CN"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-279","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"宿主发出一个 `call` 后不必等它结束就可以发下一个；`output` 与 `done` 仍按 `id` 关联。因此**同一个访客实例的多个 `call` 并发执行**。`meta`、`apply`、`dispose` 仍然独占执行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-280","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"宿主调用带 `seq`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-281","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"访客到宿主的 `provide`、`view`、`invoke` 带一个访客自己分配的 `seq`，宿主以 `{ seq, result }` 或 `{ seq, error }` 应答。宿主在自己的读线程上处理宿主调用，所以多条可以交叉在途，而且**不要求属于任何导出**——访客可以在 `apply` 之后保留一个宿主句柄，从任何线程、任何时刻调用宿主","locale":"zh-CN"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-282","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"宿主到访客的事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2291":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-283","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"宿主随时可以发送 `{ event: name, payload }`；访客立即收到，不必等某个导出结束","locale":"zh-CN"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-284","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"取消与 ping","locale":"zh-CN"},"2293":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-285","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"与版本 2 相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-286","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"版本 3 对访客作者的要求是：`call` 与事件处理可能同时进行，它们共享的状态要放到锁或原子后面。宿主侧的对应能力是 `GuestService::emit`（发事件）与 `Host::detached()`（脱离导出调用宿主）；WASM 与动态库后端没有到运行中访客的通道，这两项在那里会返回错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-287","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"`dispose` 之后进程会被杀死；stdin 关闭时访客退出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2296":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-288","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"例如，上面的 `Counter` 访客在没有配置的情况下被应用，然后被调用一次：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2297":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-289","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"在 `kardia-guest/3` 下相同的过程（宿主提供版本 2 的名字，访客回答版本 3）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2298":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-290","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#process","content":"宿主此时可以不加 `id` 直接发送 `{\"event\":\"settings\",\"payload\":{\"theme\":\"dark\"}}`，访客会在下一次有机会时处理它；访客也可以在拿到 `apply` 的宿主句柄后，从任意线程发送 `{\"seq\":1,\"call\":\"view\",\"key\":\"db\"}`，而这一行不带任何 `id`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2299":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-291","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#interop","content":"其他语言的 SDK 只需实现上面的协议，而不用链接 kardia。`pykardia` 是同一套模型的 Python 实现：`pykardia.guest.export` 把一份 Python 源码导出成自包含的可执行文件（进程访客）、CFFI 动态库或 WASI 模块，三种产物都能被 kardia 直接加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2300":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-292","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#interop","content":"加载它们不需要写代码：`kardia-hmr` 带一个示例，用真实的 `Loader` 与 `Hmr` 跑一个访客并把结果打印成 JSON。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2301":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-293","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#interop","content":"后端按文件自动选择：`.wasm` 或 `.wat` 走 wasmtime，带可执行位的是子进程，其余按动态库加载。`--replace <file>` 会把该文件移到访客自己的路径上，并在同一次运行中经 HMR 热重载，因此重载行为也可以直接观察。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2302":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-294","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#interop","content":"这条路径由 pykardia 的 CI 守着：它检出 kardia、构建这个示例，再让上面三种产物依次通过真实加载器，包括热重载。两边的版本约定只有这一节描述的协议本身——`kardia-hmr` 的 crate 文档（`cargo doc -p kardia-hmr --open`）是它的权威来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2303":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-295","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"`examples/plugins/hello.wat` 是用 WebAssembly 文本手写的访客。它从 `cordis` 模块导入 `write` 和 `log`，并导出 `memory` 和三个函数：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2304":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-296","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"`cordis_meta` 写出 `{\"plugin\":{\"name\":\"hello\"}}`：一个名为 `hello` 的插件，没有依赖、注入或提供。它返回 `0`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2305":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-297","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"`cordis_apply` 忽略其输入（从不 `read` 消息），并以级别 `2`（info）记录 `hello from wasm`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2306":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-298","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"`cordis_dispose` 记录 `goodbye from wasm`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2307":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-299","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"没有 `cordis_call`，因为该插件不提供任何服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2308":{"id":"/docs/guide-guests-300","page_id":"/docs/guide-guests","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-guests#hello","content":"用 `cargo run -p kardia -- examples/kardia.yml` 运行它并编辑问候语：`hmr` 会原地重载该模块，于是旧实例先记录道别，新实例再记录你的问候语。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2309":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"page","content":"热重载","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","locale":"zh-CN"},"2310":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","content":"用 hmr 插件原地重载访客模块：配置监视模式，搭建模块图，运行 reconcile 事务，并了解失败如何处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2311":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"监视访客模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"2312":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#setup","content":"在应用中启用热重载","locale":"zh-CN"},"2313":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"模块与模块图","locale":"zh-CN"},"2314":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#host","content":"宿主模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"2315":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"reconcile 事务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2316":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"`ReconcileResult`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2317":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"重载如何替换插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2318":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"监视模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2319":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","content":"编译进二进制的插件可以在运行时重新配置，但修改其代码需要重启。**访客插件**（guest plugin）是独立的模块，`hmr` 插件（`kardia-hmr`）可以原地重载它们：模块变化时，它导出的插件会在其运行中的纤程（fiber）背后被替换，应用的其余部分随之跟进。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2320":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","content":"Rust 没有模块注册表（registry），因此由宿主（host）自己维护一个：`ModuleGraph` 从 `ModuleSource` 加载模块代码。`Hmr` 服务重载发生变化的模块，并通过 `registry.replace` 原地替换它们导出的插件；开启 `watch.enabled`（并有 `std:fs` 服务）时，它会随文件变化自动这样做。如何编写模块本身见访客插件；调和过程如何实现见加载器内部实现，TypeScript 原版见 HMR。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2321":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","content":"HMR 必须依赖 `std:fs`，目录来自作用域内的 `fs.baseUrl`；`hmr.base` 已移除。若需更换目录，在 HMR 条目设置 `intercept: { \"std:fs\": { baseUrl: \"./plugins\" } }`。include 会把 FS 作用域设为该配置文件所在目录，嵌套 include 同样如此。`watch.files` 和日志路径相对于此目录；非 file base 属于配置错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2322":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"要在访客模块变化时重载它们，在配置文件中加入一个开启监视模式的 `hmr` 条目：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2323":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`HmrConfig`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2324":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2325":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2326":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2327":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`watch.enabled`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2328":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`false`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2329":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"文件变化时重载。需要 `std:fs` 服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2330":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`watch.files`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2331":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`[\".\", \"!**/.*\", \"!**/target\"]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2332":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"要监视的文件：相对于作用域内的 `fs.baseUrl` 的模式，与 `std:fs` 监视过滤器的写法相同。前导 `!` 表示排除，匹配某路径或其某个祖先的最后一个模式起决定作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2333":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`watch.debounce`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2334":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`100`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2335":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"在这么多毫秒内发生的变化一起重载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2336":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"开启 `watch.enabled` 且 `files` 列表非空时，`hmr` 记录 `watching [..] in <base>`，并在自身之下启动一个等待 `fs` 的监视。若 `fs` 已存在，监视会在 `hmr` 稳定之前建立好；建立失败会被记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2337":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#config","content":"`kardia` 二进制注册了 `hmr`（也以 `@cordisjs/plugin-hmr` 注册），并把任何不是内置插件的条目名解析为相对于配置文件的访客模块，所以 `examples/kardia.yml` 会热重载 `plugins/hello.wat`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2338":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#setup","content":"`ModuleGraph` 同时也是一个 `Resolver`，因此加载器（loader）可以通过它解析条目名；`Hmr::plugin(graph)` 是基于同一个图的 `hmr` 插件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2339":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#setup","content":"若要同时使用内置插件和访客模块，像二进制那样先经插件目录解析、再经模块图解析即可（见加载器）。若要通过加载器的配置文件重载，在目录中以 `hmr` 注册 `Hmr::plugin(graph)`，再加入一个 `hmr` 条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2340":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"**模块**由 `ModuleId` 标识，即一个绝对路径（`/app/plugins/foo.wasm`）。其代码来自 `ModuleSource`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2341":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"模块的 `evaluate` 通过 `Imports` 拿到其依赖的导出（`imports.get(id)`；对导出值的依赖可用 `imports.value(id)`），并返回它自己导出的内容。`ModuleCode::new(deps, evaluate)` 用于构造。除自定义来源外，还有三个从文件加载访客模块的后端：`WasmSource`、`DylibSource` 和 `ProcessSource`（见访客插件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2342":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`ModuleGraph` 是宿主维护的模块注册表，相当于参考实现中 Node 的模块缓存：已加载的模块、它们之间的边以及它们的导出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2343":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2344":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2345":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`ModuleGraph::new(source)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"基于某个来源的模块图","locale":"zh-CN"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`graph.import(id)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"导入一个模块及其依赖（依赖先导入）并缓存。在环中，仍在导入过程中的模块被视为 `Exports::None`。加载失败的模块不会被保留，所以下次导入会重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`graph.resolve(name)`（作为 `Resolver`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2350":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"导入 `name` 并返回其插件；否则以 `module <name> does not export a plugin` 失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2351":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`graph.mark_host(ids)`、`graph.is_host(id)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2352":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"宿主模块（见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2353":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`graph.is_loaded(id)`、`graph.loaded()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2354":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"已加载的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"`graph.edges(id)`、`graph.exports(id)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2356":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#graph","content":"某个已加载模块的依赖和导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#host","content":"静态链接的插件天然就是**宿主模块**：程序本身只能通过重启来改变，而这些插件的运行时*重新*配置仍完全由加载器支持。如果你把宿主的某些部分建模为图中的模块，请用 `graph.mark_host(ids)` 标记它们。对宿主模块的修改不会被应用；它会在 `ReconcileResult::skipped_host_modules` 中报告，监视模式会给出警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2358":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#host","content":"宿主模块发出的边不会让它们随所导入的模块一起重载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2359":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"`HmrExt::reconcile` 在 `Hmr` 服务上运行一次**事务**。其回调报告发生变化的文件或目录（绝对路径）；位于其中某个路径或其下方的每个已加载模块（按完整路径段比较）都会被重载：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2360":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"不是绝对路径的根会使事务失败：`invalid root <path>, expected an absolute path`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2361":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"事务一次只运行一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2362":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"在另一个事务内部（在其回调中，或在正被运行中的事务重载的插件中）启动事务，会以 `cannot start a transaction inside another transaction` 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2363":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"事务遵循参考代码（而不是论文的算法 10）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2364":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**匹配。** 发生变化的模块是位于所报告的根或其下方的已加载模块；其中的宿主模块只做报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2365":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**接受。** 发生变化的模块，以及导入了某个已接受模块的每个模块（宿主模块除外），都被接受。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2366":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**过期插件。** 模块闭包触及某个已接受模块的每个已注册插件都是过期的。由多个模块导出的插件（例如某个模块重新导出了它）从最外层的导出者取得替换，即没有被其他导出者导入的那个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2367":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**阶段 1：导入。** 驱逐过期插件的模块，并重新导入每个过期插件。这是唯一可能失败的步骤；有效性在这里检查，此时只有模块缓存发生了变化，所以后续阶段无需回滚。在所有插件都导入完之前不恢复任何内容，因此没有新模块会链接到被驱逐的旧模块。导入错误会被记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**单元。** 闭包（在旧图或新图中）共享某个被驱逐模块的插件组成一个**单元**，一起提交或一起放弃。含导入失败的单元被放弃：其中任何内容都不会应用，其模块的缓存条目会被恢复；其他单元不受影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2369":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**阶段 2：替换。** 每个已提交的插件都通过 `registry.replace` 原地替换，并记录为 `reload plugin at <module>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2370":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#reconcile","content":"**阶段 3：稳定。** 被替换的纤程并发地稳定下来。不做回滚：应用失败的插件保持失败，与冷启动时一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2371":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2372":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2373":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"`settled_fibers: Vec<Fiber>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2374":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"被替换且已稳定的纤程（位于另一个被重载纤程之下的纤程可能已被它释放，不包含在内）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2375":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"`import_failures: Vec<ImportFailure>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2376":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"每个被放弃的单元一项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2377":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"`skipped_host_modules: Vec<ModuleId>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2378":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"发生变化的宿主模块，只有重启才能应用它们；其他变化都已应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2379":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#result","content":"`ImportFailure` 包含 `modules`（该单元中被驱逐的模块，已排序，其缓存条目已恢复）和 `error`（该单元中某个模块导入失败的原因；若它不再导出插件，则为 `invalid plugin at <module>, expect a plugin export`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2380":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"替换经由 `registry.replace` 进行，因此插件的每个纤程都保留其标识、父纤程、配置和加载器条目；只有背后的实现改变。纤程先卸载（其效应，包括旧的访客实例，都被释放），然后加载新实现。对 `hello.wat` 而言，旧实例先记录道别，然后新实例记录新的问候语。访客会得到一个状态全新的新实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2381":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"可能出错的情况及其结果：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2382":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2383":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2384":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"变化后的模块无法加载，或不再导出插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2385":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"其单元被放弃：其中任何内容都不重载，旧模块仍留在缓存中，运行中的插件继续使用旧代码。其他单元照常重载。在监视模式下，它的文件会在下一批中重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2386":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"新实现在 `apply` 中失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2387":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"纤程变为 `Failed`，与冷启动时一样；不做回滚。之后再次重载该模块（或 `update` 该条目）可以恢复它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2388":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"事务本身失败（错误的根、嵌套事务、回调失败）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2389":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#replacing","content":"什么都不重载；返回该错误（在监视模式下记录为警告，并重试所有文件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2390":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"在监视模式下，`hmr` 通过 `std:fs` 服务监视作用域内的 `fs.baseUrl`，把文件变化转化为事务：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2391":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"每次变化都以调试级别记录（`change detected at <path>`，路径相对于作用域内的 `fs.baseUrl`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2392":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"变化会被收集，直到连续 `debounce` 毫秒没有新的变化；该窗口内的变化作为一批一起重载（`reconcile N changed files`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2393":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"各批次一次运行一个，每一批都会接手上一批保留下来的文件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2394":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"导入失败的文件在下一批中重试（其导入失败已由事务记录）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2395":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"若事务本身失败，它的所有文件都会重试，错误记录为警告；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2396":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"对宿主模块的修改只做报告（`skipped host modules: …`），因为是否重启由宿主决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2397":{"id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-hot-reload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-hot-reload#watch","content":"监视是 `hmr` 纤程之下的一个效应（effect），随它一起结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2398":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"page","content":"加载器","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader","locale":"zh-CN"},"2399":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader","content":"用声明式条目运行插件：搭建加载器及其插件目录，从 Rust 驱动树、分组与条目，以双向同步的方式引入配置文件，并定位配置错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2400":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"搭建加载器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2401":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"条目、分组与树","locale":"zh-CN"},"2402":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#api","content":"从 Rust 驱动加载器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2403":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"`Loader`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2404":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#handles","content":"`TreeHandle`、`GroupHandle`、`EntryHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2405":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"创建、更新、移动与移除","locale":"zh-CN"},"2406":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#backends","content":"树后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2407":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#isolation","content":"通过条目隔离与拦截","locale":"zh-CN"},"2408":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#include","content":"引入配置文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2409":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#patches","content":"补丁","locale":"zh-CN"},"2410":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#writes","content":"写入与冲突","locale":"zh-CN"},"2411":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#include-api","content":"`Include` 句柄","locale":"zh-CN"},"2412":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#errors","content":"定位配置错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2413":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-loader#patch-context","content":"`on_patch_context` 钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"2414":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader","content":"**加载器**（loader，`kardia-loader`）维护一棵由**条目**（entry，即插件名加上其配置）组成的树，并让它与运行中的纤程（fiber）双向保持一致：对条目的修改会被调和到运行中的纤程，插件自行更新或释放（dispose）时也会被回写到它的条目。**include**（配置文件引入）插件（`kardia-include`）把 YAML 或 JSON 文件中的条目嫁接到这棵树上，并让文件双向保持同步。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2415":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader","content":"本页是库使用者的视角：如何搭建加载器、从 Rust 驱动它、引入文件、查找配置错误。条目字段本身（`id`、`name`、`config`、`group`、`disabled`、`inject`、`intercept`、`isolate`）和表达式列在配置文件中。加载器如何实现见加载器内部实现，它与 TypeScript 加载器的所有不同之处列在状态与偏差中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2416":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`Loader::plugin(resolver)` 返回加载器插件。它运行后提供 `loader` 服务：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2417":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"**解析名称。** 加载器通过 `Resolver` 把条目的 `name` 转换成 `PluginDef`，相当于模块导入。解析可以是异步的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2418":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`Catalog` 是静态解析器：按名称组织的插件注册表（registry）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2419":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`Catalog` 方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2420":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2421":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`Catalog::new()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2422":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"空目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2423":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`catalog.register::<P>()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2424":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"以 `P::NAME` 注册一个类型化插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2425":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`catalog.register_def(name, def)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2426":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"以给定名称注册一个 `PluginDef`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2427":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`catalog.alias(alias, name)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2428":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"让 `alias` 解析为 `name` 所解析的插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2429":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`catalog.get(name)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2430":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"查找一个名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"找不到的名称以 `ModuleNotFound`（`Cannot find plugin 'name'`）失败，加载器报告它时会定位到条目的 `name`（见定位配置错误）。`kardia_loader::builtins()` 是一个含 `group` 插件（也以 `@cordisjs/plugin-group` 注册）的目录；`kardia::catalog()` 在此之上加入 `timer`、`logger-console`、`fs` 和 `include`，每个也以其 TypeScript 包名注册。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2432":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"解析器可以组合多种来源。`kardia` 二进制从其目录中解析内置插件，并把其他任何名称视为相对于配置文件的访客模块路径：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2433":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"`Loader::plugin_with(resolver, backend)` 还可以设置加载器自身那棵树的后端（见树后端）；`Loader::plugin` 使用 `MemoryTree`，只把树保存在内存中。`crates/kardia/src/main.rs` 展示了二进制的完整搭建过程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2434":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#setup","content":"Resolver 接收父分组的上下文，其中包含配置文件的 FS 作用域。读取 FS 的解析器应在安装 Loader 时声明该依赖。独立的 `TreeBackend::base_dir` 和 `TreeHandle::base_dir` 已移除，目录由上下文的 FS 提供。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2435":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**条目**是一个由选项组成的 JSON 对象。JSON 始终是事实来源，因此未知键会被容忍并在回写时保留。键保持稳定的顺序：`id`、`name`，其余按字母序，`config` 最后。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2436":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**分组**（group）是带 `group: true`、运行 `group` 插件的条目。它的 `config` 是一个条目列表，分组在每次更新时原地调和这个列表而不是重启：条目按 id 并发地创建、更新和移除，一个坏条目不会阻止其他条目。分组本身从不被禁用；它的 `disabled` 判定会传给其成员。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2437":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**树**（tree）是一组共用一个后端的分组，后端负责持久化它的变化。加载器自己的树位于内存中。插件可以创建子树（`loader.create_tree(ctx, backend)`）；include 为每个文件这样做。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2438":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**id** 在一棵树内唯一。没有 id 的条目会得到一个随机的八位十六进制 id。在嵌套的树之间，条目有一个**复合 id**：各层树所有者的 id 和它自己的 id 用 `:`（`kardia_loader::SEP`）连接，如 `include:hmr`；因此 `id` 不得包含 `:`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2439":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**类型化视图。** `EntryOptions::read(&options)` 把已校验的选项读成类型化视图（`id`、`name`、`config`、`group`、`disabled: Option<Disabled>`（其中 `Disabled::{Bool, Expr}`）、`inject`、`intercept`、`isolate: Vec<(String, IsolateLabel)>`（其中 `IsolateLabel::{Private, Shared(label)}`））；JSON 对象仍是事实来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2440":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**带 `inject` 的条目有两个纤程。** 声明了 `inject` 的条目运行一个外层纤程（标记为 `loader:outer`，即 `kardia_loader::OUTER_TAG`），它持有依赖、解析插件、通过一次 `ctx.checkpoint()?`，然后启动运行插件的内层纤程。没有 `inject` 的条目只有内层纤程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2441":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#model","content":"**条目何时运行。** 字面量 `disabled: true` 或被禁用的祖先分组会阻止条目运行。`disabled` 表达式在外层纤程的上下文（context）中求值（该上下文能看到条目的 `inject`）；求值失败时条目被禁用，并报告失败。接着对条目的 `intercept` 求值；`intercept` 无法求值时插件不会运行。`config` 中的表达式在每次加载时于插件的上下文中插值，源配置保留表达式本身；分组的 `config` 是其条目列表，不做插值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2442":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#api","content":"加载器有三类句柄：`TreeHandle`、`GroupHandle` 和 `EntryHandle`。`Loader` 自己的 `create`、`remove`、`update`、`resolve`、`entries` 和 `root` 作用于它自己的树。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2443":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2444":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2445":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"`Loader::plugin(resolver)` / `Loader::plugin_with(resolver, backend)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2446":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"加载器插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2447":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"`loader.create(options, parent, position).await`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"创建一个条目，返回其复合 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"`loader.update(id, patch, parent, position).await`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"修补一个条目，并可移动它","locale":"zh-CN"},"2451":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"`loader.remove(id)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2452":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#loader-api","content":"移除一个条目","locale":"zh-CN"}