n` 处（会被截断到有效范围；`None` 表示追加到末尾），然后启动它。分组条目在其插件加载时才创建分组，所以仍在加载中的 `parent` 会被等待。（来自文件或分组更新的条目改为浅层校验，每个分组成员在其分组调和它时校验；校验函数是 `kardia_loader::validate_options(&options, deep)`。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2508":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"**`update(id, patch, parent, position)`** 把 `patch` 合并进选项（`null` 删除一个键），校验结果并应用。`parent: None` 表示条目留在原处；`Some(None)` 把它移到根分组，`Some(Some(id))` 把它移入条目 `id` 的分组，也可以跨树移动：移入另一棵树时，条目的分组成员会一起移动；若其中某个 id 在目标树中已存在，则移动失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2509":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"更新对运行中插件的影响取决于改了什么：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2510":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"`name` 或 `inject` 改变，或条目未在运行：重建条目（先释放它的纤程，再重新启动）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2511":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"否则就地修补运行中的纤程：条目连同新的隔离表被重新挂到它（新的）分组之下（重新挂接条目的上下文时，其下的所有纤程也随之移动，就像重新指向的 JavaScript 原型），`intercept` 原地替换，改变后的 `config` 以 `fiber.update_with(config, true)` 的形式到达插件，插件的更新钩子可以接管它而不重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2512":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"**`remove(id)`** 释放条目，并把它从所在分组中移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2513":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"**回写。** 插件对自身的修改会到达它的条目：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2514":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"自行释放的插件被持久化为 `disabled: true`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2515":{"id":"/docs/guide-loader-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-loader","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-loader#crud","content":"自行更新配置的插件（`fiber.update(..)`，它会发出 `Co