plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins","content":"用 Rust 编写的插件（plugin）会编译进你的应用。本页介绍如何声明服务（service）、编写提供和使用服务的插件、启动它们，以及让配置文件能够使用它们。API 为什么是这个样子，见 API 设计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2646":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#add-the-dependency","content":"`use kardia::prelude::*;` 引入大多数插件需要的名字：`Context`、`Plugin`、`PluginDef`、`Inject`、`Injected`、`Service`、`Svc`、`Fiber`、`Result`、两个宏、定时器、`Loader`、`Deserialize` 和 `json!`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2647":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"服务就是普通类型。`#[plugin]` 宏从插件的函数签名中读取它的依赖，因此访问未声明的服务会导致编译错误：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2648":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"运行过程：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2649":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"`greeter` 声明了 `database` 和 `timer`，在二者都可用之前一直处于等待状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2650":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"`db` 提供 `database`，于是 `greeter` 启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2651":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"更新 `db` 的配置会让它重启。`greeter` 依赖它，所以 `greeter` 先停止，再用新的数据库重新启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2652":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"释放（dispose）`db` 会撤回 `database`：`greeter` 停止，它的 interval 被撤销，`closing` 日志作为拆除过程的一部分输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2653":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"一个更长、可运行的版本，还演示了热替换数据库的实现：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2654":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#a-first-example","content":"使用门面 crate `kardia` 时，两个宏都要写 `crate = ::kardia`。生成的代码默认引用 `::kardia_core`，只有直接依赖 `kardia-core` 时才能用默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2655":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#services","content":"服务是绑定到一个**键**（key）上的任意 `Send + Sync + 'static` 类型，键是字符串。之所以用字符串而不是类型 id，是因为配置文件要通过名字引用服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2656":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#services","content":"`#[derive(Service)]` 默认把类型名转成连字符形式作为键，除非给出 `name`。`Service` trait 还有一个成员 `merge_intercept`，用于合并拦截（interception）元数据；它的默认实现（对 JSON 对象做右偏的浅合并）适用于大多数服务。见服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2657":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"插件在 `apply` 中提供服务：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2658":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2659":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"提供","locale":"zh-CN"},"2660":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"`ctx.provide(value)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2661":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"一个 `Service` 值，使用它自己的键","locale":"zh-CN"},"2662":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#providing-a-service","content":"`ctx.provide_arc(arc)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2663"