tent":"受检访问读取的是插件的**已提交视图**（committed view）：插件启动时解析到的那些绑定。访问从插件自身提供的服务开始，沿祖先向上查找，在隔离边界处停止，返回插件所提交的第一个绑定。由于消费者读取的是已提交视图而不是实时存储，消费者自身被拆除期间，它的依赖仍然可读（元理论中的定理 70）。根上下文（context）可以不受检查地访问实时存储。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2693":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#using-a-service","content":"带类型的访问返回 `Svc<S>`，它解引用为 `S`，并记住发起访问的上下文（调用者）。`timer` 之类的服务利用调用者，把它们代你完成的工作记为*你的*插件的效应；调用者归属、拦截和事件见服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2694":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugins","content":"插件就是论文中的组件（component）`(d, p, e)`：它依赖的服务（`d`）、它提供的服务（`p`），以及它运行时执行的效应（`e`）。编写插件有四种方式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2695":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"函数必须是 `async`，并返回 `Result<()>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2696":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"第一个参数是 `Context`（不声明依赖）或 `Injected<(A, B, …)>`（声明 `A`、`B`……，最多八个）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2697":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"可选的第二个参数是配置，类型为 `Arc<Config>`。没有它时，插件不接受配置（`()`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2698":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"宏会生成一个以函数名的驼峰形式命名的插件类型（`hello_world` → `HelloWorld`，`user` → `User`），并保留原函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2699":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","content":"参数：`name` 设置插件名（默认是连字符形式的函数名，即 `hello-world`），`provide` 列出它提供的键，`crate` 是 kardia crate 的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2700":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#plugin-macro","c