-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"处于 `Failed` 状态的插件通过 `update` 或注册表中的实现替换来清除失败；`restart()` 和依赖刷新都不会清除错误。`update_with(config, true)` 同样可以恢复，并且不发出用于配置回写的 `ConfigCommitted` 事件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2764":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#fiber-handle","content":"`Fiber::set_recovery` 已支持 `Manual`（默认）、限频 `Retry` 和 `Host` 处理；监督位于失败实例之外，等待清理，并随释放或策略切换取消。loader 条目通过 `recovery` 提供相同选择，见配置与示例及原生故障证据。`restart()` 仍不清除失败，手动处理使用 `update`，选择监督策略后由监督逻辑驱动恢复操作。每种策略都必须保持无关插件正常运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2765":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"配置以 JSON 形式进入（来自配置文件、`plugin_value` 或 `update`），每次加载时用 serde 解码一次，得到 `Config`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2766":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"解码错误会指出失败的路径，例如 `invalid config: … (at items.1)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2767":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"未知字段会被容忍，除非配置类型显式启用 `#[serde(deny_unknown_fields)]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2768":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"缺失的配置（`null`）按空对象读取，因此所有字段都有默认值（`#[serde(default)]`）的配置类型可以接受它。`()` 接受任何值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2769":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"`fiber.update(value)` 先校验新配置：被拒绝的配置不会影响运行中的实例。新配置随后交给插件的更新钩子；如果没有钩子接管，插件就会重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2770":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#configuration","content":"`ctx.on_update_with` 作用相同，但它的钩子返回一个 future，`update` 会等待这个 future 完成。钩子是一个效应，因此会随插件一同消失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2771":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#stopping-cleanly","content":"插件通过其上下文注册的一切都是效应，在插件停止时被撤销：提供的服务、监听器、定时器、子插件，以及 `ctx.on_dispose(…)` 这样的普通撤销函数（disposer）。效应的完整介绍见效应；编写 `apply` 时有两点需要注意：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2772":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#stopping-cleanly","content":"**获取资源后立即注册它的逆操作**，这样插件在启动过程中被停止时也不会泄漏任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2773":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#stopping-cleanly","content":"**`ctx.checkpoint()?`** 是过时的加载在此停止的位置。如果插件的目标在本次加载开始后发生了变化（被更新、被释放或失去了某个依赖），它返回 `Err(Interrupted)`。从 `apply` 返回这个错误并不算失败：插件会卸载它目前为止注册的内容。kardia 自身从不取消正在运行的 `apply`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2774":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#loading-your-plugins-from-a-config-file","content":"加载器（loader）负责解析每个条目的 `name`。要从配置文件加载你自己的插件，把它们注册到一个 `kardia::loader::Catalog` 中，再传给 `Loader::plugin`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2775":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#loading-your-plugins-from-a-config-file","content":"`kardia::catalog()` 包含除 `hmr` 以外的所有内置插件（`hmr` 需要一个模块图，见热重载），每个插件同时以自己的名字和对应的 TypeScript 包名注册；`kardia::loader::builtins()` 只包含 `group`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2776":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#loading-your-plugins-from-a-config-file","content":"不在目录中的条目名会以 `ModuleNotFound` 失败，错误位置指向该条目的 `name`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2777":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#loading-your-plugins-from-a-config-file","content":"`Loader::plugin` 接受任何 `kardia::loader::Resolver`，`Catalog` 就是其中一种。`kardia` 可执行文件使用自己的解析器，对不是内置插件的名字回退到访客模块：完整的配置方式（包括 `hmr`）见 `crates/kardia/src/main.rs`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2778":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#next","content":"<Card title=\"服务\" href=\"/docs/guide-services\" description=\"调用者归属、拦截、事件与日志。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2779":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#next","content":"<Card title=\"效应\" href=\"/docs/guide-effects\" description=\"效应、撤销函数、效应作用域与拆除。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2780":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#next","content":"<Card title=\"加载器\" href=\"/docs/guide-loader\" description=\"在 Rust 中使用条目、分组、隔离与 include。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2781":{"id":"/docs/guide-plugins-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-plugins#next","content":"<Card title=\"API 设计\" href=\"/docs/development-design\" description=\"插件 API 为什么是现在这个样子。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2782":{"id":"/docs/guide-server","page_id":"/docs/guide-server","type":"page","content":"HTTP 与 WebSocket 服务","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","使用指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-server","locale":"zh-CN"},"2783":{"id":"/docs/guide-server-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-server","content":"在同一插件系统中使用 Server、ACL、Echo、Static 和 Proxy，并选择故障恢复策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2784":{"id":"/docs/guide-server-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-server#example","content":"运行完整示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2785":{"id":"/docs/guide-server-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-server#rust","content":"在 Rust 插件中注册路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"2786":{"id":"/docs/guide-server-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-server#recovery","content":"选择