","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"反射式访问：本领域的现存绑定（其提供者须处于活动状态）；对未声明的键也不会失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2914":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`ctx.live_as::<T>(key)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2915":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Option<Svc<T>>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2916":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"同上，按键","locale":"zh-CN"},"2917":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"**受检访问**（论文的算法 6）按如下方式解析一个键：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2918":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"途经的某个纤程自己在同一领域中提供的绑定，直接返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2919":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"否则沿派生出该上下文的纤程向上查找。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2920":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"遇到再次隔离该键的上下文（隔离边界）时停止：该键视为未声明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2921":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"第一个声明了该键的纤程决定结果：返回该纤程加载时**提交**的绑定；声明了该键却没有已提交绑定的纤程得到 `Inactive`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2922":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"根上下文无法声明 `inject`，它对现存存储有**不受检**的访问权，与 Cordis 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2923":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"受检访问读取的是已提交视图而不是现存存储，所以即使提供者已从存储中消失，消费者在自己拆除期间仍能读取依赖（论文定理 70）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2924":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"错误：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2925":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`AccessError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2926":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"消息","locale":"zh-CN"},"2927":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Undeclared { key }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2928":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`cannot get property \"key\" without inject`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2929":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`Inactive { key }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2930":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`cannot get required service \"key\" in inactive context`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2931":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`TypeMismatch { key, expected }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2932":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#accessing","content":"`service \"key\" is not of type …`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2933":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`Injected<D>` 包装一个插件上下文，其类型化访问在编译期按声明的依赖 `D` 检查。`#[plugin]` 宏从函数签名读出 `D`，同时生成依赖声明和包装：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2934":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`Injected::get::<S, _>()`：`_` 是 `S` 在 `D` 中被推断出的位置（`kardia_core::index::I0` … `I7`），无需手写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2935":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`Injected::deps()` 以 `Svc` 元组形式返回 `D` 中的全部服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2936":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`Injected::context()` 返回底层不受检的 `Context`；`Injected<D>` 也解引用为它，因此 `Context` 的其他方法都可直接使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2937":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#injected","content":"`#[plugin(name = \"…\", provide = [\"key\"], crate = path)]` 作用于一个 `async fn`，其第一个参数为 `Context` 或 `Injected<(..)>`，可选的第二个参数为 `Arc<Config>`。它生成一个以函数名的驼峰形式命名的插件类型（`greeter` → `Greeter`），插件名默认为连字符化的函数名，可用 `name` 指定。编写插件的内容见插件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2938":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"每次访问都返回一个 `Svc<T>`：服务值加上**调用者**（caller），即发起访问的上下文。Cordis 用 JavaScript `Proxy` 归属调用；kardia 把调用者显式地放进句柄。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2939":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2940":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"2941":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-services","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-services#svc","content":"`*svc`（`Deref`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2942":{"id":"/docs/guide-services-113"