":[],"url":"/docs","locale":"zh-CN"},"3194":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Cordis 的 Rust 实现：一个建立在时空可组合性之上的插件框架。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3195":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#kardia-cordis-and-the-paper","content":"kardia、Cordis 与论文","locale":"zh-CN"},"3196":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#baseline","content":"移植基线","locale":"zh-CN"},"3197":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#how-this-documentation-is-organised","content":"文档的组织方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3198":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#concepts-the-paper","content":"概念：论文","locale":"zh-CN"},"3199":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#cordis-reference-the-typescript-code","content":"Cordis 参考：TypeScript 代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3200":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#development-the-rust-design","content":"开发：Rust 设计","locale":"zh-CN"},"3201":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#suggested-reading-order","content":"推荐阅读顺序","locale":"zh-CN"},"3202":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#where-to-go-next","content":"接下来去哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"3203":{"id":"/docs-9","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"kardia 是 Cordis 的 Rust 实现。Cordis 是一个建立在时空可组合性（*spatiotemporal composability*）之上的插件框架（论文）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3204":{"id":"/docs-10","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"一个应用是一棵由**插件**（plugin）组成的树。每个插件运行在一个**纤程**（fiber）中：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3205":{"id":"/docs-11","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"**效应**（effect）：插件建立的一切（监听器、定时器、服务、子插件）都会被追踪，并在插件停止时撤销。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3206":{"id":"/docs-12","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"**服务**（service）：插件提供