ontext#construction","content":"`new Context()` 构建**根**上下文（`context.ts:36-49`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3420":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-19","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"创建空的 `isolate`/`intercept` 表（`Object.create(null)`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3421":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-20","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"用 `ReflectService.handler` 把自身包装进一个 `Proxy`。这个代理*就是*所有人看到的上下文；`this[symbols.root] = self`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3422":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-21","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"创建**根纤程（fiber）** `new Fiber(self, {}, {}, null, …)`（runtime 为 `null` ⇒ 根，uid 0，`ACTIVE`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3423":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-22","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"在根上实例化四个内置服务（service）：`reflect`、`registry`、`events`、`logger`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3424":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-23","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#construction","content":"调用 `this.fiber._disposables.clear()`。构造期间注册的内置 mixin 与访问器*不*属于根纤程的可撤销效应（revertible effect）：它们必须在 `root.fiber.dispose()` 之后依然存在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3425":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-24","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"`context.ts:55-63`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3426":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-25","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"每个派生上下文都是其父上下文的**原型链子对象**。这实现了论文中的*派生实现*（derived realization，定义 23）：子对象覆盖部分槽位，其余全部继承。无需撤销任何东西：丢弃子对象即丢弃了这次调整。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3427":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-26","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"`isolate(name, label?)`（`context.ts:65`）创建 `Object.create(this[symbols.isolate])`，设置 `shadow[name] = label ?? Symbol(name)` 并以此扩展。新符号给出私有领域（realm）；共享的 `label` 给出共享领域。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3428":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-27","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"`intercept(name, config)`（`context.ts:73`）以相同模式处理拦截（interception）表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3429":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-28","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"纤程的上下文是 `parent.extend({ fiber: this })`（`fiber.ts:150`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3430":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-29","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#extend","content":"**关键性质：** 隔离（isolation）表与拦截表都是*原型链*。查找（`table[name]`）看到最近的覆盖；`Object.hasOwn(table, name)` 检测恰好在这一层引入的隔离边界（`locate` 使用了这一点）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3431":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-30","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#realm-symbols","content":"`ReflectService.provide` 惰性地分配根领域：`ctx[symbols.root][symbols.isolate][name] ??= Symbol(name)`（`reflect.ts:222`）。因此，一旦被提供，*每个*服务名在根表中都有一个领域符号；被隔离的上下文会覆盖它。**存储以领域符号为键**，从而得到定义 24 的两层解析 `k → ρ(k) → σ(ρ(k))`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3432":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-31","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`reflect.ts` 持有共享的根级表：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3433":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-32","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3434":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-33","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"论文","locale":"zh-CN"},"3435":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-34","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3436":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-35","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`store: Dict<Impl, symbol>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3437":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-36","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"σ（`@@store`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3438":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-37","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"领域符号 → 当前 `Impl`（绑定）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3439":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-38","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`props: Dict<Property>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3440":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-39","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"–","locale":"zh-CN"},"3441":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-40","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"已声明的上下文属性：`{type:'service'}` 或 `{type:'accessor', get, set}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3442":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-41","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`_implCounter`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3443":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-42","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"新鲜名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"3444":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-43","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#reflect-service","content":"`Impl` 的 uid 来源（从不复用）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3445":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-44","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#impl","content":"`reflect.ts:65-75`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3446":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-45","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"`reflect.ts:213-249`。`provide` 是一个 `fiber.effect`（因此被追踪且可撤销），其回调：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3447":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-46","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"把 `props[name]` 注册或校验为服务（若已是访问器则报错）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3448":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-47","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"确保存在根领域符号，并计算 `key = ctx[isolate][name]`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3449":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-48","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"执行**单一来源检查**：若 `store[key]` 已存在，抛出 `service \"x\" has been registered at <fiber>`（O-Insert 的不相交性，按领域计）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3450":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-49","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"设置 `store[key] = impl` 与 `fiber.provisions.add(impl)`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3451":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-50","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"若提供者（provider）纤程已是 `ACTIVE`，立即调用 `notify([name])`；否则在该纤程变为 `ACTIVE` 时通知（`Fiber._updateState`），对应“只有 Active 纤程提供服务”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3452":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-51","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"它的**逆操作**是异步的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3453":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-52","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"删除存储条目（若仍指向此 impl），并 `notify` 该 impl 所在领域中的依赖方；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3454":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-53","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"**提供者侧守卫**：`await` 直到 `impl.dependents` 为空（`impl.release` 由最后一个依赖方的卸载来 resolve）。它总会至少让出一次，使子级清理仍能访问继承来的服务；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3455":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-54","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#provide","content":"从 `fiber.provisions` 中移除该 impl。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3456":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-55","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#set","content":"`reflect.ts:200-211`。原地覆盖*自己的*绑定（`impl.value = value`）；若该名称未被提供或由其他纤程提供则报错。**不发出通知**：正如论文所说，原地覆盖不会被依赖方观察到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3457":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-56","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#get","content":"`reflect.ts:188-198`。解析 `ctx[isolate][name]` → `store[key]`。在 `strict` 模式下，除非 `impl.ctx.fiber.state === ACTIVE`，否则什么也不返回（**提供者可用 = Active**）。它从不抛出异常。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3458":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-57","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#notify","content":"`reflect.ts:251-270`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3459":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-58","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#notify","content":"这就是算法 3。*filter* 参数的存在是为了让加载器（loader）在领域重新分配时替换领域判定（算法 7，见托管领域）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3460":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-59","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`accessor(name, {get, set})` 与 `mixin(source, keys)` 位于 `reflect.ts:272-308`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3461":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-60","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`accessor` 声明一个计算出的上下文属性（作为可撤销效应）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3462":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-61","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`mixin('events', ['on', 'emit', …])` 把某个服务的成员暴露为上下文属性（`ctx.on` → `ctx.events.on`），并绑定到发起访问的上下文。它是一个生成器效应，每个键产出一个访问器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3463":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-62","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"根上下文的接线（`reflect.ts:182-185`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3464":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-63","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"3465":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-64","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"混入上下文的键","locale":"zh-CN"},"3466":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-65","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`reflect`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3467":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-66","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`get`、`set`、`provide`、`accessor`、`mixin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3468":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-67","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`fiber`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3469":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-68","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`runtime`、`effect`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3470":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-69","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`registry`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3471":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-70","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`inject`、`plugin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3472":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-71","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`events`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3473":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-72","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#accessor-mixin","content":"`on`、`once`、`parallel`、`emit`、`serial`、`bail`、`waterfall`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3474":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-73","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"`ReflectService.handler`（`reflect.ts:105-170`）在其 `get` 陷阱中中介 `ctx.foo`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3475":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-74","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"*特殊*属性（符号、`prototype`、`then`、数字字符串、以 `_` 开头的名称）绕过中介；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3476":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-75","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"普通的自有或继承属性经 `getTraceable` 返回（见服务与可追溯性）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3477":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-76","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"已声明的**访问器** → 其 getter；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3478":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-77","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"若*定义点*（def site，即影子，见服务与可追溯性）是**根纤程** → 不加检查的 `reflect.get(prop, false)`（根代码无法声明 `inject`）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3479":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-78","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"否则在 `locate(defSite, prop)` 外包一层 `waterfall('internal/get', …)`（允许插件钩住访问）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3480":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-79","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"找到 impl → 其值（经追踪）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3481":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-80","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"纤程声明了该键但没有已提交的 impl → `cannot get required service \"x\" in inactive context`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3482":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-81","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"无人声明 → `cannot get property \"x\" without inject`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3483":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-82","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"`set` 陷阱：非根纤程上未声明的属性 → 错误 `cannot set property without provide`；访问器 → 其 setter；服务 → `waterfall('internal/set')` → `reflect.set`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3484":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-83","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#proxy","content":"错误先以廉价占位符创建，只在被抛出时才以裁剪过的栈具体化（`createAccessError`/`enhanceAccessError`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3485":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-84","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"`reflect.ts:83-102` 实现算法 6，并扩展了自有提供与隔离边界：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3486":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-85","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"推论（均由 `tests/isolate.spec.ts` 与 `reflect.spec.ts` 覆盖）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3487":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-86","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"消费者（consumer）读取的是**已提交**的 impl，而非实时存储，因此在自身拆除期间仍能看到其依赖（定理 70）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3488":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-87","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"子插件*继承*祖先的依赖声明（在祖先上声明的 `inject` 允许后代访问）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3489":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-88","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#locate","content":"隔离边界会终止继承（`does not inherit the injected view across isolation boundaries`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3490":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-89","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"`Service[symbols.resolveIntercept]`（`service.ts:57-70`）在访问时解析名为 `name` 的服务的元数据：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3491":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-90","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"遍历上下文的拦截原型链，按**外 → 内**收集自有值；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3492":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-91","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"以最低优先级前置*组件（component）声明*的元数据 `locate(caller, name).fiber.inject[name]`（声明方纤程在 `inject: { name: meta }` 中给出的值）。自有提供没有这一项，且遍历在隔离边界处停止；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3493":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-92","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"用 `service[symbols.mergeIntercept]` 合并（默认 `Object.assign({}, ...values)`，即右侧优先）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3494":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-93","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#interception","content":"这正是定义 27 中的 `σ(k)(d(k) ⊕ ι(k))`，其中 ⊕ = 浅层对象合并（每个服务可自定义）。`logger` 服务用它处理 `{ name, level }`（`logger.ts:213-224`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3495":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-94","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#design-observations","content":"**一切都在根上。** 每个根只有一个 `store`、一个 `props` 和一个 `registry`；派生上下文之间的区别只在于原型链上的 `isolate`/`intercept` 表及其 `fiber`。这让“键 k 是否在领域 r 中被提供？”保持为一次映射查找。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3496":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-95","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#design-observations","content":"**提供者身份**是 `Impl.uid`，一个新鲜的计数器值。它实现了已提交视图与目标视图中“看名称而非值”的原则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3497":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-96","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#design-observations","content":"**按领域符号隔离**实现了放宽后的演算规则“在领域内不相交”（§4.4，见元理论）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3498":{"id":"/docs/reference-context-97","page_id":"/docs/reference-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-context#design-observations","content":"**没有编译期检查**：声明的键与访问的键只在运行时由代理检查（论文 §5.1.4 指出这本可以静态完成）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3499":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"page","content":"效应","breadcrumbs":["kardia 文档","Cordis 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-effects","locale":"zh-CN"},"3500":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-0","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-effects","content":"Cordis 核心如何追踪可撤销效应：可接受的形态、执行引擎、fiber.effect、所有权转移与拆除顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3501":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-1","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-effects#shapes","content":"可接受的效应形态","locale":"zh-CN"},"3502":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-2","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-effects#execute","content":"引擎 `_execute(runner)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3503":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-3","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-effects#fiber-effect","content":"`fiber.effect(execute, label)`：被追踪的效应","locale":"zh-CN"},"3504":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-4","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-effects#ownership","content":"嵌套与所有权转移","locale":"zh-CN"},"3505":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-5","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference-effects#disposable-list","content":"`DisposableList`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3506":{"id":"/docs/reference-effects-6","page_id":"/docs/reference-effects","type":"heading","tags":[