nce-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#state","content":"为无 id 的文件条目生成的 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"3933":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-35","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#state","content":"`dirtyRead` / `dirtyWrite`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3934":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-36","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#state","content":"IO 标志","locale":"zh-CN"},"3935":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-37","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#state","content":"`_draining`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3936":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-38","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#state","content":"正在运行的 IO 循环","locale":"zh-CN"},"3937":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-39","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#state","content":"`_pendingTree` / `_applyTask`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3938":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-40","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#state","content":"最新者胜出的应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3939":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-41","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#io-loop","content":"`index.ts:365-397`。单飞（single-flight）的 `_drain` 运行 `while (dirtyRead || dirtyWrite) { read-if-dirty; write-if-dirty }`。读取错误只是**警告**（编辑期间文件写到一半是常态），并在不写入的情况下停止循环（文件状态未知）；写入错误被记录，循环继续。`commit(change)`（来自树）记录到变更记录（journal）中，设置 `dirtyWrite` 并排空。`refresh()`（监听器）设置 `dirtyRead`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3940":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-42","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#read","content":"读取；内容相同 ⇒ 什么也不做（这也抑制了自身写入引起的监听器回馈）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3941":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-43","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/do