","locale":"zh-CN"},"3950":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-52","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#write","content":"只读文件把变更保留在内存中，并给出警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3951":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-53","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#apply","content":"`applyPatches(cache.data, patches)`（每次都是新克隆，因此移除补丁即可还原）→ `applyJournal(data, journal)`（叠加尚未写入的运行时变更）→ 最新者胜出的 `root.update(tree)` → `EntryGroup` 按键协调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3952":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-54","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`journal.ts` 由纯函数组成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3953":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-55","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"3954":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-56","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"3955":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-57","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`record`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3956":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-58","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"在报告时捕获的增量","locale":"zh-CN"},"3957":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-59","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`mergeRecords`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3958":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-60","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"remove∘created-upsert = 无；remove 之后的 upsert ⇒ `created:false`；changes 按较新者胜出合并","locale":"zh-CN"},"3959":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-61","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`flatten`、`applyChanges`、`detach`、`place`、`applyJournal`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3960":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-62","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"把记录应用到条目列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"3961":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-63","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"`reconcile(journal, base, theirs, fileOwned)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3962":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-64","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#journal","content":"三方合并，冲突的键/移动/移除会从 journal 中丢弃（“文件胜出”）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3963":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-65","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"`patch.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3964":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-66","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"**插入补丁** `{ id?, insert: [...] }` 把条目追加到某个分组（或根）中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3965":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-67","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"**覆盖补丁** `{ id, name?, ...keys }` 覆盖现有条目的键。若给出 `name`，它必须匹配（防止误给另一个插件打补丁）；覆盖分组的 `config` 会替换其子级列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3966":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-68","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"`applyPatches` 构建一个 `PatchIndex`，记录每个条目与键的**所有者**：`file`、`patch{index}` 或 `embedded{index, key}`。后面的补丁可以引用前面补丁插入的条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3967":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-69","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#patches","content":"`routeJournal` 把每次运行时编辑写回其所有者：补丁拥有的键 → 该补丁；由补丁插入的条目 → 补丁内部；其余 → 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3968":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-70","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#source-locations","content":"`_route(id, path)` 找到某个值被写在哪里（文件、补丁、嵌入），并沿嵌套的 include 向上委托，生成形如 `at a (inner.yml:1:3)` / `at inc (middle.yml:1:3)` 的虚拟栈帧。`walk` 下降遍历 YAML AST（把别名解析到锚点）；`seekExpr`/`scanScalar` 把表达式内部的偏移映射为文件偏移（解码带引号标量中的转义）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3969":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-71","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"3970":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-72","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"所在","locale":"zh-CN"},"3971":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-73","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"`ConfigFileError(stage: 'read'\\|'parse'\\|'validate', path, cause, issues[])`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3972":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-74","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"include","locale":"zh-CN"},"3973":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-75","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"`StaleWriteError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3974":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-76","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"include（内部）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3975":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-77","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"`EntryValidationError`、`ModuleNotFoundError`、重定位后的 `ValidationError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3976":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-78","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-include#errors","content":"加载器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3977":{"id":"/docs/reference-include-79","page_id":"/docs/reference-include","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference-i