` is a struct (`Disposer::new`, `fallible`, `future`, `try_future`), not a boxed-closure type alias."],[5501,"`Disposer` is a struct consumed when it runs (`Disposer::new(FnOnce())`, `fallible(FnOnce() -> Result<()>)`, `future(..)`, `try_future(..)`); its closure runs synchronously when disposal starts and may return a future that finishes the work. Panics are caught and reported as errors."],[948,"`Disposer` 是一个在运行时被消耗的结构体（`Disposer::new(FnOnce())`、`fallible(FnOnce() -> Result<()>)`、`future(..)`、`try_future(..)`）；它的闭包在释放开始时同步运行，并且可以返回一个完成剩余工作的 future。panic 会被捕获并作为错误报告。"],[1563,"`Disposer` 是一个结构体（`Disposer::new`、`fallible`、`future`、`try_future`），而不是装箱闭包的类型别名。"],[1868,"`Disposer` 是效应的逆操作。它在运行时被消耗，因此至多运行一次："],[4329,"`disposition`"],[8882,"`disposition`"],[76,"`dom(F)`"],[86,"`dom(F)`"],[225,"`dom(F)`"],[4634,"`dom(F)`"],[4644,"`dom(F)`"],[4783,"`dom(F)`"],[1312,"`DylibSource`"],[5865,"`DylibSource`"],[4969,"`𝔇Σ := Set(K)`."],[413,"`𝔇Σ := Set(K)`。"],[49,"`e_n` 的一次迭代可以实例化一个组件：它执行 `π = n` 的 O-Insert，并**以新纤程的 O-Retire 作为其逆操作产出**。逆操作*使其退役而不是移除*，因为逆操作必须总是可应用的，而 O-Remove 带有前提（一个 Active 子纤程会阻止它）。一个已退役、Inactive 且为空的条目是*残留的*（vestigial）（引理 62，见元理论）：它与不存在无法区分。使子纤程退役不会让父纤程等待；孙纤程逐层处理。"],[233,"`e`"],[4791,"`e`"],[4582,"`e`: a witnessed **effect iterator** (witnessed up to `≃_{d∪p}`): the effects contributed while active, plus their inverses."],[21,"`e`：一个带见证的**效应迭代器**（在 `≃_{d∪p}` 意义下带见证）：组件激活期间贡献的效应（effect），以及它们的逆操作。"],[215,"`effect(e)`"],[4773,"`effect(e)`"],[4827,"`effect` accepts both effect functions and iterators (ad-hoc polymorphism); the guard is checked at each iteration boundary."],[5158,"`effect` returns an inverse at the next level"],[605,"`effect` 在下一层返回逆操作"],[270,"`effect` 既接受效应函数也接受迭代器（特设多态）；守卫在每个迭代边界处检查。"],[5143,"`effect^iter` lands in the same `∂Γ → ∂²Γ` as `effect`, so **an iterator is an effect** and composes anywhere an effect can (nesting)."],[590,"`effect^iter` 与 `effect` 落在同一个 `∂Γ → ∂²Γ` 中，因此**迭代器就是效应**，凡是能用效应的地方都能组合迭代器（嵌套）。"],[5505,"`EffectHandle::dispose()` r