y` 和三个函数："],[4325,"`exclude`"],[8878,"`exclude`"],[8079,"`execute()` produces the effect value;"],[3526,"`execute()` 产生效应值；"],[4173,"`execute(cb, guard)`"],[8726,"`execute(cb, guard)`"],[256,"`execute` 的迭代循环"],[4814,"`execute`'s iteration loop"],[2110,"`exit()`"],[6663,"`exit()`"],[2114,"`exited()`"],[6667,"`exited()`"],[2208,"`Exited`"],[6761,"`Exited`"],[5548,"`Exporter` trait objects registered via `logger.exporter(e)` **as effects**;"],[3083,"`Exporter` 接收每条消息："],[4323,"`extensions`"],[8876,"`extensions`"],[5130,"`𝔈Γ := Γ → Γ × (Γ → Γ)`, with `e(γ) = (δ, g)`: new context `δ`, inverse `g`."],[576,"`𝔈Γ := Γ → Γ × (Γ → Γ)`，其中 `e(γ) = (δ, g)`：新上下文 `δ`，逆操作 `g`。"],[5131,"`𝔈Γ*` additionally carries a **witness** `(δ, g) = e(γ) ⇒ g(δ) = γ`: the inverse reverts the effect *at the state where it was applied*. A uniform inverse with `g ∘ f = id` is a special case."],[577,"`𝔈Γ*` 还带有一个**见证**（witness）`(δ, g) = e(γ) ⇒ g(δ) = γ`：逆操作在*效应被应用时的状态*下撤销该效应。满足 `g ∘ f = id` 的统一逆操作是其特例。"],[4771,"`𝔈Γ`, `ℑΓ`"],[213,"`𝔈Γ`、`ℑΓ`"],[6429,"`f` runs synchronously when disposal starts and returns a future that finishes the work"],[561,"`f` 的撤销是一个**左逆** `g`（`g ∘ f = id`，从不要求 `f ∘ g`）；论文直接称之为*逆操作*。"],[7694,"`fail()` starts failure handling synchronously; cleanup finishes asynchronously, and `settled()` rejects when the failure settles. Ordinary `restart()` does not clear failure; manual recovery uses `update`. Automatic recovery does not emit configuration write-back events. Retry delays must be finite, positive and at most 2,147,483,647 milliseconds, avoiding JS timer overflow and rapid retries. An unchanged `ValidationError` is not automatically retried, including when a host handler returns retry."],[3141,"`fail()` 同步发起失效处理，清理异步完成；`settled()` 在失败结算后拒绝。普通 `restart()` 不清除失败，手动恢复使用 `update`。自动恢复不触发配置写回事件。retry 延时必须为有限正数且不大于 2,147,483,647 毫秒，避免 JS 定时器溢出导致高频重试。`ValidationError` 不会在配置未变时被自动重试，host 返回 retry 也一样。"],[1953,"`Failed`"],[6506,"`Failed`"],[3758,"`FAILED`"],[8311,"`FAILED`"],[7376,"`Failure` says what failed: `phase` is `Phase::Start` when the constructor's `apply` returned an error or panicked, and `Phase::Running` when a running instance faulted. A start failure repeats identically on every retry, so a policy that wants to stop there returns `KeepFailed` for it. `attempts` is the automatic restarts this supervisor made before the failure."],[2823,"`Failure` 会说明失败发生在哪里：构造器的 `apply` 返回错误或 panic 时 `phase` 为 `Phase::Start`；运行中的实例失效时为 `Phase::Running`。启动失败在每次重试中都会同样失败，策略若不愿继续，可为它返回 `KeepFailed`。`attempts` 是本次失败前已完成的自动重启次数。"],[4327,"`fallthrough`"],[8880,"`fallthrough`"],[1798,"`false`"],[1810,"`false`"],[1831,"`false`"],[2328,"`false`"],[3837,"`false`"],[6351,"`false`"],[6363,"`false`"],[6384,"`false`"],[6881,"`false`"],[8390,"`false`"],[4921,"`Fiber::set_recovery` now selects `Manual` (default), bounded `Retry`, or `Host` handling. The supervisor outlives the failed instance, waits for cleanup and cancels on disposal or policy changes. Loader entries expose the same choice through `recovery`; see configuration and examples and native fault evidence. `restart()` still does not clear failure; manual handling uses `update`, while selected supervision drives the supported recovery operation. Unrelated plugins must remain operational under every policy."],[5583,"`Fiber::set_recovery` now selects `Manual` (default), bounded `Retry`, or `Host` handling. The supervisor outlives the failed instance, waits for cleanup and cancels on disposal or policy changes. Loader entries expose the same choice through `recovery`; see configuration and examples and native fault evidence. `restart()` still does not clear failure; manual handling uses `update`, while selected supervision drives the supported recovery operation. Unrelated plugins must remain operational under every policy."],[7317,"`Fiber::set_recovery` now selects `Manual` (default), bounded `Retry`, or `Host` handling. The supervisor outlives the failed instance, waits for cleanup and cancels on disposal or policy changes. Loader entries expose the same choice through `recovery`; see configuration and examples and native fault evidence. `restart()` still does not clear failure; manual handling uses `update`, while selected supervision drives the supported recovery operation. Unrelated plugins must remain operational under every policy."],[5319,"`Fiber::set_recovery` now selects `Manual` (default), bounded `Retry`, or `Host` handling. The supervisor outlives the failed instance, waits for cleanup and cancels on disposal or policy changes. Loader entries expose the same choice through `recovery`; see configuration and examples and native fault evidence. `restart()` still does not clear failure; manual handling uses `update`, while selected supervision drives the supported recovery operation. Unrelated plugins must remain operational under every policy. In-process unwind handling cannot contain abort, segfault or process-wide termination. Use existing process/WASM boundaries where needed; native dylibs do not provide crash isolation."],[365,"`Fiber::set_recovery` 已支持 `Manual`（默认）、限频 `Retry` 和 `Host` 处理；监督位于失败实例之外，等待清理，并随释放或策略切换取消。loader 条目通过 `recovery` 提供相同选择，见配置与示例及原生故障证据。`restart()` 仍不清除失败，手动处理使用 `update`，选择监督策略后由监督逻辑驱动恢复操作。每种策略都必须保持无关插件正常运行。"],[1030,"`Fiber::set_recovery` 已支持 `Manual`（默认）、限频 `Retry` 和 `Host` 处理；监督位于失败实例之外，等待清理，并随释放或策略切换取消。loader 条目通过 `recovery` 提供相同选择，见配置与示例及原生故障证据。`restart()` 仍不清除失败，手动处理使用 `update`，选择监督策略后由监督逻辑驱动恢复操作。每种策略都必须保持无关插件正常运行。"],[2764,"`Fiber::set_recovery` 已支持 `Manual`（默认）、限频 `Retry` 和 `Host` 处理；监督位于失败实例之外，等待清理，并随释放或策略切换取消。loader 条目通过 `recovery` 提供相同选择，见配置与示例及原生故障证据。`restart()` 仍不清除失败，手动处理使用 `update`，选择监督策略后由监督逻辑驱动恢复操作。每种策略都必须保持无关插件正常运行。"],[766,"`Fiber::set_recovery` 已支持 `Manual`（默认）、限频 `Retry` 和 `Host` 处理；监督位于失败实例之外，等待清理，并随释放或策略切换取消。loader 条目通过 `recovery` 提供相同选择，见配置与示例及原生故障证据。`restart()` 仍不清除失败，手动处理使用 `update`，选择监督策略后由监督逻辑驱动恢复操作。每种策略都必须保持无关插件正常运行。 进程内 unwind 捕获不能隔离 abort、段错误或进程终止；需要这种边界时使用现有进程/WASM 机制，原生动态库不提供崩溃隔离。"],[5523,"`Fiber::update(value