y be interrupted; unrelated plugins must continue working."],[3132,"`fiber.setRecovery(policy)` 为一个插件句柄选择恢复策略，跨越该插件实例的卸载与重新加载。默认是 `{ type: \"manual\" }`，不强制重启。故障只影响失败实例及依赖其服务的消费者，无关插件必须继续工作。"],[5891,"`fiber.setRecovery` supports manual (default), bounded retry and asynchronous host decisions; `fiber.fail` reports instance failure. Timer callback errors are operation failures, and disposal awaits in-flight callbacks. Available in source, not yet in a new npm release; see details."],[1338,"`fiber.setRecovery` 支持 manual（默认）、限频 retry 和异步 host 决策；`fiber.fail` 报告实例失效。timer 回调错误只记录为操作失败，卸载等待在途回调。源码已实现，尚未发布新的 npm 版本；见说明。"],[1966,"`fiber.settled()`"],[6519,"`fiber.settled()`"],[5927,"`fiber.spec` (inertia locks 1–3, failure, update, dispose of pending/failed), `update.spec` (concurrent updates), `service.spec`, `service-dispose.spec` (guards, drain ordering, concurrent sibling cleanup), `plugin.spec`, `replace.spec`, `isolate.spec`, `reflect.spec`"],[9108,"`fiber.spec` (inertia locks, failure, update), `update.spec` (concurrent updates), `service-dispose.spec` (guard and drain ordering), `isolate.spec`, `shadow.spec`, `associate.spec`, `replace.spec`, `dispose.spec` (effect shapes), `events.spec`"],[1374,"`fiber.spec`（惯性（inertia）锁 1–3、失败、更新、释放 pending/failed 的纤程（fiber））、`update.spec`（并发更新）、`service.spec`、`service-dispose.spec`（守卫、排空顺序、并发的兄弟清理）、`plugin.spec`、`replace.spec`、`isolate.spec`、`reflect.spec`"],[4555,"`fiber.spec`（惯性锁、失败、更新）、`update.spec`（并发更新）、`service-dispose.spec`（守卫与排空顺序）、`isolate.spec`、`shadow.spec`、`associate.spec`、`replace.spec`、`dispose.spec`（效应形态）、`events.spec`"],[1962,"`fiber.state()`"],[6515,"`fiber.state()`"],[4798,"`fiber.state` (`LOADING` = Reloading; `FAILED` carries the error)"],[240,"`fiber.state`（`LOADING` = Reloading；`FAILED` 携带错误）"],[4836,"`fiber.target` is a digest tupling the uid of each declared key's provider. A **uid is never reused**, so a replaced provider is never mistaken for the old one even if the values are equal. Consequently a provi