ion, and the bridge runs `apply` and `dispose` the same way. Process guests do their I/O on threads of their own, so a deadline holds whichever thread waits. The transport traits (`GuestCode`, `GuestInstance`) are public, for a host's own transport, and so is each backend's guest code (`ProcessGuest`, `WasmGuest`), so a host can give a guest's metadata itself. An instance that fails (a trap, fuel, time or memory used up, a process that ended or was killed) fails its call with a typed `GuestFailure`, apart from the guest's own errors; the threads kardia-hmr starts catch their panics, which become the failure of the guest they serve; a guest provides only the services its metadata declares; wasmtime's process-wide trap handling on macOS (Mach ports or signals) is one setting for every engine kardia-hmr makes (Guest plugins). The `kardia` binary chooses a backend by file extension and does not load process guests."],[1316,"`GuestService::call` 会阻塞调用者直到访客应答；`call_async` 更接近论文 §6.2 中的异步 RPC 约定：它在异步工作线程之外执行，带有截止时间和取消，桥接插件也以同样的方式执行 `apply` 和 `dispose`。进程访客的 I/O 在各自的线程上进行，因此无论哪个线程在等待，截止时间都能生效。传输 trait（`GuestCode`、`GuestInstance`）是公开的，供宿主实现自己的传输；各后端的访客代码（`ProcessGuest`、`WasmGuest`）同样公开，因此宿主可以自己给出访客的元数据。失败的实例（陷阱，燃料、时间或内存耗尽，进程结束或被杀死）以带类型的 `GuestFailure` 使调用失败，与访客自己的错误区分开；kardia-hmr 启动的线程会捕获自己的 panic，使之成为其所服务访客的失败；访客只能提供其元数据声明的服务；wasmtime 在 macOS 上进程级的陷阱处理方式（Mach 端口或信号）对 kardia-hmr 创建的所有引擎是同一个设置（访客插件）。`kardia` 二进制按文件扩展名选择后端，并且不加载进程访客。"],[6608,"`GuestService::emit` (events to a guest) and `Host::detached()` (host calls outside an export)"],[2055,"`GuestService::emit`（宿主到访客的事件）与 `Host::detached()`（导出外调用宿主）"],[2072,"`GuestService`"],[6625,"`GuestService`"],[1912,"`handle.dispose()`"],[6465,"`handle.dispose()`"],[1910,"`handle.is_active()`"],[6463,"`handle.is_active()`"],[1908,"`handle.label()`"],[6461,"`handle.label()`"],[1916,"`handle.meta()`"],[6469,"`handle.meta()`"],[1914,"`handle.ready()`"],[6467,"`handle.ready()`"],[2083,"`handle()`"],[2479,"`handle()`"],[2539,"`handle()`"],